(4136012, 594847, 34618, '<td valign="top">Although there are at least three human beings in the shot and it, therefore, technically meets the Challenge specs, there doesn''t appear to be any setup involved like in many of the entries that clearly do have setups and so are, in my mind, portraits. To me this seems more of a snapshot than a portrait. Very nice colors, though.</td>', 'Although there are at least three human beings in the shot and it, therefore, technically meets the Challenge specs, there doesn''t appear to be any setup involved like in many of the entries that clearly do have setups and so are, in my mind, portraits. To me this seems more of a snapshot than a portrait. Very nice colors, though.', '2007-10-03 02:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
