(4136990, 594743, 66038, '<td valign="top">Three or more?</td>', 'Three or more?', '2007-10-03 10:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137073, 594307, 72200, '<td valign="top">Go Steelers!!</td>', 'Go Steelers!!', '2007-10-03 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137096, 594451, 39825, '<td valign="top">cute idea! and nice colour.</td>', 'cute idea! and nice colour.', '2007-10-03 11:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137128, 593922, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the editing and tones but to me a portrait has to be deliberate. Looks like a snapshot with nice editing.  Not trying to sound harsh, but that''s the way I see it. ;~D</td>', 'Love the editing and tones but to me a portrait has to be deliberate. Looks like a snapshot with nice editing.  Not trying to sound harsh, but that''s the way I see it. ;~D', '2007-10-03 11:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137132, 594413, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful but to be a portrait, the humans (or pets, etc) need to be the focus.  The softness movement, etc is lovely but this is a landscape.  If it were in FS I''d give it a 7</td>', 'This is beautiful but to be a portrait, the humans (or pets, etc) need to be the focus.  The softness movement, etc is lovely but this is a landscape.  If it were in FS I''d give it a 7', '2007-10-03 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137135, 593815, 15711, '<td valign="top">At least this is a legitimate portrait.  I think what hurts it is the overall flat feel of it.  The lighting or perhaps over usage of Neat Image has given them an almost plastic feel. I love the hats and the carefree positioning but it has a certain flatness to the skin.  Not trying to be harsh, just constructive.  That''s why I didn''t enter. ;~D</td>', 'At least this is a legitimate portrait.  I think what hurts it is the overall flat feel of it.  The lighting or perhaps over usage of Neat Image has given them an almost plastic feel. I love the hats and the carefree positioning but it has a certain flatness to the skin.  Not trying to be harsh, just constructive.  That''s why I didn''t enter. ;~D', '2007-10-03 11:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137146, 594377, 15711, '<td valign="top">A legtimate portrait but the lighting is really hurting this shot.  I''d have used fill flash.  Might work great in BW and an adjustment of channel mixer in monotone to lighten their faces. Not meaning to be harsh, but.....</td>', 'A legtimate portrait but the lighting is really hurting this shot.  I''d have used fill flash.  Might work great in BW and an adjustment of channel mixer in monotone to lighten their faces. Not meaning to be harsh, but.....', '2007-10-03 11:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137153, 592842, 15711, '<td valign="top">FUNNY. I think this would be great in black and white since so much is going on with the varioius stripes, positions, etc.  What a cute family.</td>', 'FUNNY. I think this would be great in black and white since so much is going on with the varioius stripes, positions, etc.  What a cute family.', '2007-10-03 11:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137154, 594307, 33379, '<td valign="top">To bad i''m a RAVENS fan....:)</td>', 'To bad i''m a RAVENS fan....:)', '2007-10-03 11:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137155, 592437, 58691, '<td valign="top">While this is a unique shot, the definition of a portrait includes the representation of a person or persons, in which the face and its expression is predominant. I consider this a DNMC. Sorry</td>', 'While this is a unique shot, the definition of a portrait includes the representation of a person or persons, in which the face and its expression is predominant. I consider this a DNMC. Sorry', '2007-10-03 11:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137156, 594146, 15711, '<td valign="top">Funny that they are all wearing red except for Edwards.</td>', 'Funny that they are all wearing red except for Edwards.', '2007-10-03 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137160, 594451, 15711, '<td valign="top">hahaha  - interesting take on it.  Well done. Most are a bunch of snapshots or candids. This is deliberate and it worked. Love the lighting, editing and overall set up.</td>', 'hahaha  - interesting take on it.  Well done. Most are a bunch of snapshots or candids. This is deliberate and it worked. Love the lighting, editing and overall set up.', '2007-10-03 11:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137161, 594889, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is not so much a group portrait as it is of a person who happens to be in a group. The shot lacks definition and sharpness.</td>', 'This is not so much a group portrait as it is of a person who happens to be in a group. The shot lacks definition and sharpness.', '2007-10-03 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137162, 594600, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a candid.  Not a true portrait. ;~D</td>', 'This is a candid.  Not a true portrait. ;~D', '2007-10-03 11:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137166, 594620, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cute high key.  I think it would work better if the camera were not in the shot or ALL of them were holding cameras.</td>', 'Cute high key.  I think it would work better if the camera were not in the shot or ALL of them were holding cameras.', '2007-10-03 11:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137169, 593139, 58691, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t consider this a group protrait - just a picture of a group. Not on person is looking at the camera. Although, the gazebo reflection is nice.</td>', 'I wouldn''t consider this a group protrait - just a picture of a group. Not on person is looking at the camera. Although, the gazebo reflection is nice.', '2007-10-03 11:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137170, 594202, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is GREAT!!!!!  I''m sure you''ll get blasphemous comments. LOL  Funny and well done.</td>', 'That is GREAT!!!!!  I''m sure you''ll get blasphemous comments. LOL  Funny and well done.', '2007-10-03 11:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137180, 594620, 58691, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the lighting, though I would''ve voted it higher if you had cropped out the camera. It distracts from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the lighting, though I would''ve voted it higher if you had cropped out the camera. It distracts from the rest of the shot.', '2007-10-03 11:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137187, 594736, 58691, '<td valign="top">The shadows hurt this image. A reflector in front of the family would''ve helped a lot.</td>', 'The shadows hurt this image. A reflector in front of the family would''ve helped a lot.', '2007-10-03 11:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137191, 593922, 66575, '<td valign="top">nice B&amp;W.  love the DOF and and i even like that''s it''s not a straight-up portrait.  great job.</td>', 'nice B&W.  love the DOF and and i even like that''s it''s not a straight-up portrait.  great job.', '2007-10-03 11:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137197, 594801, 66575, '<td valign="top">abduction!<br/> <br/>:o)</td>', 'abduction! :o)', '2007-10-03 11:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137202, 594664, 66575, '<td valign="top">with some better staging this would have been fantastic!  as it is, the menu bar at the top of the screen is reallly distracting.</td>', 'with some better staging this would have been fantastic!  as it is, the menu bar at the top of the screen is reallly distracting.', '2007-10-03 12:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137203, 594472, 58691, '<td valign="top">This is a decent group shot, but there are a few things you could''ve corrected before posting - crop out the shadow on the lower right and cloned out the pole that is impaling head of the guy in the back on the right. Also, the three guys without sunglasses really needed them.</td>', 'This is a decent group shot, but there are a few things you could''ve corrected before posting - crop out the shadow on the lower right and cloned out the pole that is impaling head of the guy in the back on the right. Also, the three guys without sunglasses really needed them.', '2007-10-03 12:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137206, 594816, 66575, '<td valign="top">awesome expressions.  really well done.<br/> <br/>:o)</td>', 'awesome expressions.  really well done. :o)', '2007-10-03 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137211, 593016, 66575, '<td valign="top">inspiring!  i wish the little one were a tad bit happier, but great shot anyway.</td>', 'inspiring!  i wish the little one were a tad bit happier, but great shot anyway.', '2007-10-03 12:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137215, 594146, 58691, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is, but the skin tones seem a bit off. Other than that, well done.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is, but the skin tones seem a bit off. Other than that, well done.', '2007-10-03 12:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4137216, 593922, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot.  To my eye, however, it would be even better if you could have decreased the density a bit.  There is so much contrast that it almost looks cluttered.  Nice shot though.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot.  To my eye, however, it would be even better if you could have decreased the density a bit.  There is so much contrast that it almost looks cluttered.  Nice shot though.', '2007-10-03 12:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
