(4137224, 594847, 39679, '<td valign="top">I normally ignore titles...thinking that the image really should tell me all I need to know.  However, it was the title that made me look, again, at your shot and see the time-exposed images of the children.  Very subtle and very well done.</td>', 'I normally ignore titles...thinking that the image really should tell me all I need to know.  However, it was the title that made me look, again, at your shot and see the time-exposed images of the children.  Very subtle and very well done.', '2007-10-03 12:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
