(4142177, 593790, 83313, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the first woman''s face is a little harsh, but otherwise this is a nice one.</td>', 'The lighting on the first woman''s face is a little harsh, but otherwise this is a nice one.', '2007-10-04 19:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
