(4142508, 594202, 54446, '<td valign="top">Irreverent, but excellent.  (9)</td>', 'Irreverent, but excellent.  (9)', '2007-10-04 21:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142510, 594734, 54446, '<td valign="top">A superb group portrait.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  (10)</td>', 'A superb group portrait.  One of my favorites in this challenge.  (10)', '2007-10-04 21:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142592, 593016, 76430, '<td valign="top">Hi Judi.  You''ve got friends (and daughter) with some good horsepower there.  Good composition and background.  On the thumbnail I thought it was a remake of the Charlie''s Angel''s poster.</td>', 'Hi Judi.  You''ve got friends (and daughter) with some good horsepower there.  Good composition and background.  On the thumbnail I thought it was a remake of the Charlie''s Angel''s poster.', '2007-10-04 22:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142601, 593380, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and capture, but I''m trying to figure out if it''s make-up or a PP filter that is mottling the skin and everything.  I think it would be much better without alteration.</td>', 'Nice composition and capture, but I''m trying to figure out if it''s make-up or a PP filter that is mottling the skin and everything.  I think it would be much better without alteration.', '2007-10-04 22:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142607, 594377, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is a great family picture and the pose is good, but it has some shortcomings in exposure and sharpness as a challenge entry.  It''s hard to get a good exposure when the subject is in the shade and the background is in full sun.</td>', 'I''m sure this is a great family picture and the pose is good, but it has some shortcomings in exposure and sharpness as a challenge entry.  It''s hard to get a good exposure when the subject is in the shade and the background is in full sun.', '2007-10-04 22:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142613, 594156, 83313, '<td valign="top">Would be a wonderful photo, but for some very visible pixelation.</td>', 'Would be a wonderful photo, but for some very visible pixelation.', '2007-10-04 22:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142617, 593139, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. Everything is very centered, which is normally not good, but I think breaking the rules worked for this one.</td>', 'Nice reflection. Everything is very centered, which is normally not good, but I think breaking the rules worked for this one.', '2007-10-04 22:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142627, 594327, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice scene. too bad the bird is partially blocking the boy like that, but animals tend to not want to pose...</td>', 'Nice scene. too bad the bird is partially blocking the boy like that, but animals tend to not want to pose...', '2007-10-04 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142635, 594620, 83313, '<td valign="top">Appears very blown-out, otherwise it would have been good.</td>', 'Appears very blown-out, otherwise it would have been good.', '2007-10-04 22:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142642, 594743, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but are you counting the hippo (rhinosceros?) as the 3rd member of the group?  "Include 3 or more human beings in your photograph."  DNMC but points for a cute picture.</td>', 'Nice shot, but are you counting the hippo (rhinosceros?) as the 3rd member of the group?  "Include 3 or more human beings in your photograph."  DNMC but points for a cute picture.', '2007-10-04 23:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142644, 593717, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute kids, with cute expressions. Too bad some of them are turned around.</td>', 'Cute kids, with cute expressions. Too bad some of them are turned around.', '2007-10-04 23:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142652, 594708, 75034, '<td valign="top">Interesting group of kids I like that some noticed you and most didn''t it tells a better story that way. The composition is nice and the colours warm. Good group shot.</td>', 'Interesting group of kids I like that some noticed you and most didn''t it tells a better story that way. The composition is nice and the colours warm. Good group shot.', '2007-10-04 23:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142655, 594413, 84668, '<td valign="top">out of theme.</td>', 'out of theme.', '2007-10-04 23:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142662, 593993, 75034, '<td valign="top">Is this a case of a flower between two thorns??<br/> <br/>I like the colour selection for the sweaters and the placement of the people in the photo(green,pink and green) but maybe outside on the grass with some trees would have helped this score better here.</td>', 'Is this a case of a flower between two thorns?? I like the colour selection for the sweaters and the placement of the people in the photo(green,pink and green) but maybe outside on the grass with some trees would have helped this score better here.', '2007-10-04 23:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142666, 594620, 76430, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the high key look here.  I don''t understand t(h)e title.  Otherwise a nice, creative picture.</td>', 'I don''t really like the high key look here.  I don''t understand t(h)e title.  Otherwise a nice, creative picture.', '2007-10-04 23:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142672, 594377, 75034, '<td valign="top">The(your?) daughter is adorable, as is the rest of the family.<br/> <br/>The contrast is nice and the colours are warm. It is a nice family shot I hope it does well here.</td>', 'The(your?) daughter is adorable, as is the rest of the family. The contrast is nice and the colours are warm. It is a nice family shot I hope it does well here.', '2007-10-04 23:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142676, 594795, 76430, '<td valign="top">Other than having 3 people this is not a portrait.  I don''t like the abstract border or the soft focus or zoomed perimeter.  Isn''t the goal light supposed to be on?  Otherwise it''s a good action shot.</td>', 'Other than having 3 people this is not a portrait.  I don''t like the abstract border or the soft focus or zoomed perimeter.  Isn''t the goal light supposed to be on?  Otherwise it''s a good action shot.', '2007-10-04 23:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142680, 594751, 84668, '<td valign="top">The grass is on the girl''s face.</td>', 'The grass is on the girl''s face.', '2007-10-04 23:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142683, 594413, 76430, '<td valign="top">I may be wrong, but this looks like a California scene I''ve seen before.  Not Morro Rock, but something mid-coast.  Not a portrait, but still a nice picture.</td>', 'I may be wrong, but this looks like a California scene I''ve seen before.  Not Morro Rock, but something mid-coast.  Not a portrait, but still a nice picture.', '2007-10-04 23:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142690, 594692, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great colors and poses</td>', 'Great colors and poses', '2007-10-04 23:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142694, 592396, 75034, '<td valign="top">It is nice to see people taking photos and in this era of digital photography people now more then ever are shooting everything.<br/> <br/>That being said, I like the caputre here in that it is so typically touristy right down to the group looking like they are saying "just hurry up and take the photo already will yah".<br/> <br/>I wonder what the two people further down were doing? Taking photos I''ll wager.</td>', 'It is nice to see people taking photos and in this era of digital photography people now more then ever are shooting everything. That being said, I like the caputre here in that it is so typically touristy right down to the group looking like they are saying "just hurry up and take the photo already will yah". I wonder what the two people further down were doing? Taking photos I''ll wager.', '2007-10-04 23:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142709, 594795, 75034, '<td valign="top">Great capture with the whole victory and defeat look. I like the edit and the story you are telling.<br/> <br/>The colour and the focus are wonderful, not overdone or understated.<br/> <br/>I think it was a good choice to focus on the Golie it shows the true moment for both sides.</td>', 'Great capture with the whole victory and defeat look. I like the edit and the story you are telling. The colour and the focus are wonderful, not overdone or understated. I think it was a good choice to focus on the Golie it shows the true moment for both sides.', '2007-10-04 23:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142710, 594595, 76430, '<td valign="top">This picture has a lot of potential, but technically it is lacking.  The yellow sign is distracting and it is noisy or something I can''t pinpoint causing the image to not be pleasing.</td>', 'This picture has a lot of potential, but technically it is lacking.  The yellow sign is distracting and it is noisy or something I can''t pinpoint causing the image to not be pleasing.', '2007-10-04 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142737, 594669, 76430, '<td valign="top">Not a portrait, but a great shot.</td>', 'Not a portrait, but a great shot.', '2007-10-04 23:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142748, 593139, 75034, '<td valign="top">Other then the title you haven''t showen us much in the way of interest. I am finding out that this site and the people on it like to be given something that they can either see right away or that they can be drawen into and find the story for themselves.<br/> <br/>Purhaps a different angle or approach all together would have helped you with this one. <br/> <br/>The lighting and colours are nice and there is nothing wrong with the composition, it just seemes to be void of an interesting subject/story.<br/> <br/>Still I wish you all the best with this shot, remember, I am only one opinion.</td>', 'Other then the title you haven''t showen us much in the way of interest. I am finding out that this site and the people on it like to be given something that they can either see right away or that they can be drawen into and find the story for themselves. Purhaps a different angle or approach all together would have helped you with this one.  The lighting and colours are nice and there is nothing wrong with the composition, it just seemes to be void of an interesting subject/story. Still I wish you all the best with this shot, remember, I am only one opinion.', '2007-10-04 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142749, 594803, 74371, '<td valign="top">Despite the fact that it took a ''group'' of guys to create the competition experienced by this loser, yes... this is DNMC. But DQ... naw! Michigan DOES Rule!!! (and it is Maize and blue, not blue and white! ;)<br/> <br/>Nice clear shot, well setup, good color. I would give it a 10 but would have to drop it to a 4 for the DNMC. But, due to the excellent statement about Michigan... a 7. (DPC voting purists please don''t hate me)</td>', 'Despite the fact that it took a ''group'' of guys to create the competition experienced by this loser, yes... this is DNMC. But DQ... naw! Michigan DOES Rule!!! (and it is Maize and blue, not blue and white! ;) Nice clear shot, well setup, good color. I would give it a 10 but would have to drop it to a 4 for the DNMC. But, due to the excellent statement about Michigan... a 7. (DPC voting purists please don''t hate me)', '2007-10-04 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142752, 594307, 74371, '<td valign="top">You guys never learn do ya? Hahaha!!! 7</td>', 'You guys never learn do ya? Hahaha!!! 7', '2007-10-04 23:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142767, 594516, 75034, '<td valign="top">You must of told them something really funny, care to share it with the rest of us?<br/>This works well for me, I like the warm tones and the colour contrast. Nice shot.</td>', 'You must of told them something really funny, care to share it with the rest of us?This works well for me, I like the warm tones and the colour contrast. Nice shot.', '2007-10-04 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142772, 594805, 74371, '<td valign="top">Nicely original! (8)</td>', 'Nicely original! (8)', '2007-10-04 23:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
