(4142794, 594670, 74371, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! Good shadowing coupled with the natural lighting is great. Great job!! (7)<br/> <br/>If these are all sisters, I feel so sorry for the Dad. I''ll send you/him one of my bottles of Grecian Formula!! ;)</td>', 'Very nice shot! Good shadowing coupled with the natural lighting is great. Great job!! (7) If these are all sisters, I feel so sorry for the Dad. I''ll send you/him one of my bottles of Grecian Formula!! ;)', '2007-10-04 23:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142814, 593815, 74371, '<td valign="top">I don''t know enough about post processing to know what to call it, but the girsls faces are just a little bit too clear...kinda otherwordly. Other than that, a wonderful shot. (7)</td>', 'I don''t know enough about post processing to know what to call it, but the girsls faces are just a little bit too clear...kinda otherwordly. Other than that, a wonderful shot. (7)', '2007-10-04 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4142815, 593016, 75034, '<td valign="top">There is one sure fire way to improve on this shot. It would make this an all time high score on this site never to be beaten ever. I''m sure that you know that deep, DEEP down in your heart if you had used NIKON, yes that''s right NIKON you would have an image that would be untouchable, an image that would stand the test of time.<br/> <br/>That being said, you will do fine just the same, I mean how can you go wrong with the five BEAUTIFUL young ladies you have here. You can''t that''s all there is to it you can''t. (nikon,NIKON,nikon.....)</td>', 'There is one sure fire way to improve on this shot. It would make this an all time high score on this site never to be beaten ever. I''m sure that you know that deep, DEEP down in your heart if you had used NIKON, yes that''s right NIKON you would have an image that would be untouchable, an image that would stand the test of time. That being said, you will do fine just the same, I mean how can you go wrong with the five BEAUTIFUL young ladies you have here. You can''t that''s all there is to it you can''t. (nikon,NIKON,nikon.....)', '2007-10-04 23:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
