(4143368, 594805, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great thinking. Think it would have worked better if the background were entirely dark, and if dad would have kept his fingers together. (6)</td>', 'Great thinking. Think it would have worked better if the background were entirely dark, and if dad would have kept his fingers together. (6)', '2007-10-05 06:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143391, 594862, 70689, '<td valign="top">Fun picture, nice lighting. (7)</td>', 'Fun picture, nice lighting. (7)', '2007-10-05 07:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143393, 593108, 70689, '<td valign="top">pretty nice picture. I can clearly understand why you chose the camera angle that you did, but to me the camera makes it a journalism-like picture of an event involving a group, rather than a group portrait. (5)</td>', 'pretty nice picture. I can clearly understand why you chose the camera angle that you did, but to me the camera makes it a journalism-like picture of an event involving a group, rather than a group portrait. (5)', '2007-10-05 07:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143397, 594833, 70689, '<td valign="top">Like the idea and nice poses from the girls. There seem to be distracting vertical lines all over the pic: was it underexposed and then adjusted in PP? Furthermore, I think the contrast is slightly over the top, loosing some detail in blacks and whites. (6)</td>', 'Like the idea and nice poses from the girls. There seem to be distracting vertical lines all over the pic: was it underexposed and then adjusted in PP? Furthermore, I think the contrast is slightly over the top, loosing some detail in blacks and whites. (6)', '2007-10-05 07:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143398, 594734, 70689, '<td valign="top">I Like this one, original group, original camera angle, nice composition. The white in the back is quite uneven and messy, you might want to calibrate your monitor and redo the post processing. (7)</td>', 'I Like this one, original group, original camera angle, nice composition. The white in the back is quite uneven and messy, you might want to calibrate your monitor and redo the post processing. (7)', '2007-10-05 07:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143399, 594819, 70689, '<td valign="top">Great, love the overall atmosphere of the image. I might have liked a slightly more exciting composition and you migh want to recheck your PP, especially around tough guy #2 and tough guy #4 (7)</td>', 'Great, love the overall atmosphere of the image. I might have liked a slightly more exciting composition and you migh want to recheck your PP, especially around tough guy #2 and tough guy #4 (7)', '2007-10-05 07:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143400, 592397, 70689, '<td valign="top">No, they are not! Which is fun and makes the picture somewhat special (6)</td>', 'No, they are not! Which is fun and makes the picture somewhat special (6)', '2007-10-05 07:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143416, 594871, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice overall picture, but I would have liked the girls to behave more like a group. Their movements are more or less incidental with respect to each other. (6)</td>', 'Nice overall picture, but I would have liked the girls to behave more like a group. Their movements are more or less incidental with respect to each other. (6)', '2007-10-05 08:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143417, 594643, 70689, '<td valign="top">good thinking, but I would have liked it more if you had given some more thought to setting and background. (6)</td>', 'good thinking, but I would have liked it more if you had given some more thought to setting and background. (6)', '2007-10-05 08:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143421, 594872, 70689, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this does not work for me. Too many things happening in one picture and a registration rather than a portrait imo. (5)</td>', 'Sorry, this does not work for me. Too many things happening in one picture and a registration rather than a portrait imo. (5)', '2007-10-05 08:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143423, 593636, 70689, '<td valign="top">nice capture, but the picture is a bit crowded, giving it a snapshottish feel. The camera angle doesn''t help either. (4)</td>', 'nice capture, but the picture is a bit crowded, giving it a snapshottish feel. The camera angle doesn''t help either. (4)', '2007-10-05 08:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143426, 594664, 70689, '<td valign="top">I <i>think</i> you might have a nice concept here, but it is so dark I can hardly recognize anything. (3)</td>', 'I think you might have a nice concept here, but it is so dark I can hardly recognize anything. (3)', '2007-10-05 08:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143431, 594158, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice wedding picture. I am sorry to say I think wedding pictures are boring. Furthermore, I feel that your picture is capturing an event, instead of taking a portrait. It''s a thin line, I know, but let me explain. I do not like that the guy''s back is so much in the picture. In an event registration, that''s fine, the guy is functional. In a portrait of the wedding couple, he''s misplaced. The same holds for the woman we see between bride and groom. Behind the bride we see a shoulder that makes the bride looks like she has huge and funny boobs. (4)</td>', 'Nice wedding picture. I am sorry to say I think wedding pictures are boring. Furthermore, I feel that your picture is capturing an event, instead of taking a portrait. It''s a thin line, I know, but let me explain. I do not like that the guy''s back is so much in the picture. In an event registration, that''s fine, the guy is functional. In a portrait of the wedding couple, he''s misplaced. The same holds for the woman we see between bride and groom. Behind the bride we see a shoulder that makes the bride looks like she has huge and funny boobs. (4)', '2007-10-05 08:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143432, 594670, 70689, '<td valign="top">Pretty girls in a pretty environment, waht more do you need to get a good picture? Well, light to start with. All the eyes are in the shade and the girls cast shades upon themselves and each other. Please be more aware of the direction of the sun and use a fill flash to soften shadows. Also, be more aware of disturbing objects in the background, lik half boats (or clone them out, it''s advanced editing). Nice holiday pic, but not a very good group portrait. (4)</td>', 'Pretty girls in a pretty environment, waht more do you need to get a good picture? Well, light to start with. All the eyes are in the shade and the girls cast shades upon themselves and each other. Please be more aware of the direction of the sun and use a fill flash to soften shadows. Also, be more aware of disturbing objects in the background, lik half boats (or clone them out, it''s advanced editing). Nice holiday pic, but not a very good group portrait. (4)', '2007-10-05 08:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143433, 593636, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the Great North Run although brings back hidepous memories of when I ran the London Marathon and was involved in a sprint race with a Pot Noodle at the end (which I won though I am ashamed to say not without the use of my elbows!!!)<br/> <br/>Far more sensible to be photographing rather than competing</td>', 'Nice shot of the Great North Run although brings back hidepous memories of when I ran the London Marathon and was involved in a sprint race with a Pot Noodle at the end (which I won though I am ashamed to say not without the use of my elbows!!!) Far more sensible to be photographing rather than competing', '2007-10-05 08:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143439, 594166, 68035, '<td valign="top">Chicks!!!???? Gee my eyesight must be worse than I thought<br/> <br/>Good studio shot, I may have prefered it without the slight body crops but certainly a picture I bet the subjects will love</td>', 'Chicks!!!???? Gee my eyesight must be worse than I thought Good studio shot, I may have prefered it without the slight body crops but certainly a picture I bet the subjects will love', '2007-10-05 08:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143440, 592842, 68035, '<td valign="top">Yup those smiles are definitely on the wane!!  I can almost hear the cries of ''Mum/Dad are you finished yet''<br/> <br/>Nice leading diagonal</td>', 'Yup those smiles are definitely on the wane!!  I can almost hear the cries of ''Mum/Dad are you finished yet'' Nice leading diagonal', '2007-10-05 08:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143453, 594681, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice clear image, with vivid colours. The pink hair is slightly blown out and I am not that sure that the focus is spot on in this image. Furthermore, I see a lot of distracting things in the back. (5)</td>', 'Nice clear image, with vivid colours. The pink hair is slightly blown out and I am not that sure that the focus is spot on in this image. Furthermore, I see a lot of distracting things in the back. (5)', '2007-10-05 08:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143462, 594156, 70689, '<td valign="top">I am not too pleased with this picture. First of all, the link to the theme is razor thin. Seems like you shot a nice pic and try to squeeze it in. Second, your horizon is not horizontal, makes viewers feel very uneasy. On top of that, the pic is quite noisy, probably due to oversharping, as it is a daylight pic without an apparant need for high ISO values. (3)</td>', 'I am not too pleased with this picture. First of all, the link to the theme is razor thin. Seems like you shot a nice pic and try to squeeze it in. Second, your horizon is not horizontal, makes viewers feel very uneasy. On top of that, the pic is quite noisy, probably due to oversharping, as it is a daylight pic without an apparant need for high ISO values. (3)', '2007-10-05 08:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143466, 594594, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but a bitt dull imo. You might consider experimenting a little with the camera angle. It would for instance be nicer to show where that ball is going. But then it wouldn''t be a portrait, right? Which reveals that this is actually not a portrait, but an action shot. I also think the b/w conversion is a bit dull, it could have used more black. (5)</td>', 'Nice picture, but a bitt dull imo. You might consider experimenting a little with the camera angle. It would for instance be nicer to show where that ball is going. But then it wouldn''t be a portrait, right? Which reveals that this is actually not a portrait, but an action shot. I also think the b/w conversion is a bit dull, it could have used more black. (5)', '2007-10-05 08:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143470, 593220, 70689, '<td valign="top">No, sorry. This is not a portrait, it is a snapshot. And not even a good one. Too many things happening in one picture, harsh lighting, silly acting people, unthoughtfull cut-off, not even an attempt at making a composition, not in focus, red eyes. (2)</td>', 'No, sorry. This is not a portrait, it is a snapshot. And not even a good one. Too many things happening in one picture, harsh lighting, silly acting people, unthoughtfull cut-off, not even an attempt at making a composition, not in focus, red eyes. (2)', '2007-10-05 08:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143474, 594595, 70689, '<td valign="top">Cool girls, cool setting. Quite some nasty details on the technical side though. The girls are not in focus, the sky is blown out as are parts of the wet street. The pose of the second girl on the left made me think she was a lilliputter at first. (4)</td>', 'Cool girls, cool setting. Quite some nasty details on the technical side though. The girls are not in focus, the sky is blown out as are parts of the wet street. The pose of the second girl on the left made me think she was a lilliputter at first. (4)', '2007-10-05 08:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143477, 592009, 70689, '<td valign="top">technically more or less okay (bit dull colours), but funny faces in portraiture is a big nono for me. Background is distracting as well (4)</td>', 'technically more or less okay (bit dull colours), but funny faces in portraiture is a big nono for me. Background is distracting as well (4)', '2007-10-05 08:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143482, 592458, 70689, '<td valign="top">All around the internet, you find webpages of teenage girls posing weird poses with funny faces, while photographing themselves with their camera-with-built-in-flash, causing blown highlights on the skins and harsh shadows. At least, yours is in focus and does not have a living room as a background. (3)</td>', 'All around the internet, you find webpages of teenage girls posing weird poses with funny faces, while photographing themselves with their camera-with-built-in-flash, causing blown highlights on the skins and harsh shadows. At least, yours is in focus and does not have a living room as a background. (3)', '2007-10-05 09:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143484, 593790, 70689, '<td valign="top">Mostly nice lighting and a genuine group portrait. Composition of the group is apparently given some thought here, and surrounding elements are functional to the picture. Not a stunning or exciting picture, but a good group portrait (8)</td>', 'Mostly nice lighting and a genuine group portrait. Composition of the group is apparently given some thought here, and surrounding elements are functional to the picture. Not a stunning or exciting picture, but a good group portrait (8)', '2007-10-05 09:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143501, 594708, 70689, '<td valign="top">Not much of a group portrait imo, rather a picture of a group. Many members of the ''group'' are behind other members or cut of from the picture. The picture contains too many elements to look at and has no clear composition to lead the viewer''s eye thruogh it. The use of DOF is nice though, and gives te picture some depth. (4)</td>', 'Not much of a group portrait imo, rather a picture of a group. Many members of the ''group'' are behind other members or cut of from the picture. The picture contains too many elements to look at and has no clear composition to lead the viewer''s eye thruogh it. The use of DOF is nice though, and gives te picture some depth. (4)', '2007-10-05 09:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143504, 594170, 70689, '<td valign="top">This is a weird picture and I''m still wondering whether I like it. At least you got me wondering, that''s cool. I think I do like the concept, but it might have worked better with a slightly smaller group, let''s say two thirds of this one. ALso, I think that the backlight does not wotk out too wel, blowing out the 2nd guy on my right, and leaving the dark suites so dark that they loose detail. (7)</td>', 'This is a weird picture and I''m still wondering whether I like it. At least you got me wondering, that''s cool. I think I do like the concept, but it might have worked better with a slightly smaller group, let''s say two thirds of this one. ALso, I think that the backlight does not wotk out too wel, blowing out the 2nd guy on my right, and leaving the dark suites so dark that they loose detail. (7)', '2007-10-05 09:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143508, 593465, 70689, '<td valign="top">This is a funny snapshot, I imagine you had fun taking it. And I do like the concept of taking the picture from the other side. But still, it is a snapshot, with distracting backgrounds and all kinds of people in the picture that have nothing to do with the picture. A tighter cropped would have helped a little. (5)</td>', 'This is a funny snapshot, I imagine you had fun taking it. And I do like the concept of taking the picture from the other side. But still, it is a snapshot, with distracting backgrounds and all kinds of people in the picture that have nothing to do with the picture. A tighter cropped would have helped a little. (5)', '2007-10-05 09:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143514, 594832, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the overall setting and composition. Nice use of the stairs, without overdoing. I do not like the facial expressions however, and they are quite fundamental in portraits. Furthermore, the crop is pretty tight on the left hand side and you leave a stretch of white on the right hand side. (4)</td>', 'I like the overall setting and composition. Nice use of the stairs, without overdoing. I do not like the facial expressions however, and they are quite fundamental in portraits. Furthermore, the crop is pretty tight on the left hand side and you leave a stretch of white on the right hand side. (4)', '2007-10-05 09:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143524, 594803, 70689, '<td valign="top">sorry you lost te bet, good luck with rebuilding your reputation.<br/> <br/>One good thing: I tink some other picture in this challenge is deliberately aiming for the brown ribbon, but you''ll beat him to it! :P (1)</td>', 'sorry you lost te bet, good luck with rebuilding your reputation. One good thing: I tink some other picture in this challenge is deliberately aiming for the brown ribbon, but you''ll beat him to it! :P (1)', '2007-10-05 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143533, 594664, 75034, '<td valign="top">I understand what you are trying to do here with the feet holding the"world" and the person lying prone and static on the floor I just don''t think that many people here will find it to be a true group shot even though there are three people in it.<br/> <br/>That being said I think the crop could do away with the black at the top to help keep the focus on the subject.</td>', 'I understand what you are trying to do here with the feet holding the"world" and the person lying prone and static on the floor I just don''t think that many people here will find it to be a true group shot even though there are three people in it. That being said I think the crop could do away with the black at the top to help keep the focus on the subject.', '2007-10-05 09:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143619, 594736, 75034, '<td valign="top">A very nice family moment. The colours are nice and soft even the shadows are not distracting. Tiny pick the table clothor leg is an eye catcher for me but sometimes you can''t crop things out because you wouldtake out important things like her toes.</td>', 'A very nice family moment. The colours are nice and soft even the shadows are not distracting. Tiny pick the table clothor leg is an eye catcher for me but sometimes you can''t crop things out because you wouldtake out important things like her toes.', '2007-10-05 09:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143649, 594166, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice group portrait. Good theme and consisten execution. The overall lighting is not very balanced, and I think the picture is cropped too tight on the left. Furthermore, the picture is a bit soft. Despite these points, it is still a good one (7)</td>', 'Nice group portrait. Good theme and consisten execution. The overall lighting is not very balanced, and I think the picture is cropped too tight on the left. Furthermore, the picture is a bit soft. Despite these points, it is still a good one (7)', '2007-10-05 09:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143662, 594847, 70689, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this picture. It combines very dark spots with overly bright ones and motion blur is so strong that it''s hard to recognize anything the kids do. In this case you might have used a rear curtain flash to freeze a part of the scene. What also bothers me is that I do not see a (recognizable) group or anyone being portrayed. I can not realy see how this fits in the challenge. (4)</td>', 'I don''t like this picture. It combines very dark spots with overly bright ones and motion blur is so strong that it''s hard to recognize anything the kids do. In this case you might have used a rear curtain flash to freeze a part of the scene. What also bothers me is that I do not see a (recognizable) group or anyone being portrayed. I can not realy see how this fits in the challenge. (4)', '2007-10-05 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143668, 594611, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice. The round shape gives depth to the picture and the facial expressions are posed but still natural. Well executed b/w conversion too, with good contrast. (7)</td>', 'Nice. The round shape gives depth to the picture and the facial expressions are posed but still natural. Well executed b/w conversion too, with good contrast. (7)', '2007-10-05 09:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143681, 594649, 70689, '<td valign="top">Fun group portrait. You might have taken an even lower(or closer) camera position to get rid of the distubring background. And to be honest, I think sepia sucks in general and it sucks even more in this pic, as it is totaly misplaced in the fairly modern context of the picture. (5)</td>', 'Fun group portrait. You might have taken an even lower(or closer) camera position to get rid of the distubring background. And to be honest, I think sepia sucks in general and it sucks even more in this pic, as it is totaly misplaced in the fairly modern context of the picture. (5)', '2007-10-05 10:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143689, 594377, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like it. Nice intimite group composition and subtle blur in the background. Bit of a pitty that the background is so much lighter than your subjects, why did you put them in the shade? (6)</td>', 'I like it. Nice intimite group composition and subtle blur in the background. Bit of a pitty that the background is so much lighter than your subjects, why did you put them in the shade? (6)', '2007-10-05 10:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143700, 594780, 66414, '<td valign="top">While I find the concept kind of amusing, I think the photo would have been better if you actually made the tire flat!</td>', 'While I find the concept kind of amusing, I think the photo would have been better if you actually made the tire flat!', '2007-10-05 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143702, 594543, 66414, '<td valign="top">To generic</td>', 'To generic', '2007-10-05 10:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143704, 594670, 66414, '<td valign="top">There is something about the look in the models eyes that you can guess who is the more responsible ones and who are the more adventeous ones.  This dichotomy works well</td>', 'There is something about the look in the models eyes that you can guess who is the more responsible ones and who are the more adventeous ones.  This dichotomy works well', '2007-10-05 10:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143708, 594664, 66414, '<td valign="top">It took me a minute to figure out how this applies to the Group Portrait title.  I like it</td>', 'It took me a minute to figure out how this applies to the Group Portrait title.  I like it', '2007-10-05 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143710, 594862, 66414, '<td valign="top">Just Simply fun!</td>', 'Just Simply fun!', '2007-10-05 10:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143711, 594740, 70689, '<td valign="top">Funny pic, but I am not too fond of the harsh lighting. (5)</td>', 'Funny pic, but I am not too fond of the harsh lighting. (5)', '2007-10-05 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143715, 594620, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but would have been stronger if cropped square imo. Furthermore, a big part of your pic is blown out. This can in some case be functional, but here it destroys the form of the faces, which I wouldn''t like to see in a portrait (4)</td>', 'Nice composition, but would have been stronger if cropped square imo. Furthermore, a big part of your pic is blown out. This can in some case be functional, but here it destroys the form of the faces, which I wouldn''t like to see in a portrait (4)', '2007-10-05 10:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143716, 594327, 66414, '<td valign="top">Great shot, although my eye can get away from the seagull in the center of the picture.  I think it would have worked better even more having waited a few seconds to get the bird more to the side or out of the picture</td>', 'Great shot, although my eye can get away from the seagull in the center of the picture.  I think it would have worked better even more having waited a few seconds to get the bird more to the side or out of the picture', '2007-10-05 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143720, 594692, 70689, '<td valign="top">cute, nice symmetry, great colors and lovely soft background. Too bad you cropped of a hand and the faces are shaded. (7)</td>', 'cute, nice symmetry, great colors and lovely soft background. Too bad you cropped of a hand and the faces are shaded. (7)', '2007-10-05 10:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143804, 594816, 70689, '<td valign="top">Nice. I like the composition, leading my eye like a spiral through the picture to the ''I'' Lighting and b/w conversion are fine, but why does the ''I'' person look so sad? Can I make you smile with a high score? (8)</td>', 'Nice. I like the composition, leading my eye like a spiral through the picture to the ''I'' Lighting and b/w conversion are fine, but why does the ''I'' person look so sad? Can I make you smile with a high score? (8)', '2007-10-05 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143828, 593993, 70689, '<td valign="top">Gee, I am not an American, and I have a vague understandig of what Ohio is (A state, right? And apparently a university, that probably has a sportsteam nicknamed Bobcats). The point is, the picture does not evoke any emotions with me. All I see is three people on a couch, wearing similar clothes, probably fanwear, and looking slightly uncomfortable. The lighting is quite harsh, the picture is not very sharp and the woman''s eyes look like you''ve corrected for red eyes in PP (either that, or she''s on something). All in all, I see a group portrait, but not a very good one. (4)</td>', 'Gee, I am not an American, and I have a vague understandig of what Ohio is (A state, right? And apparently a university, that probably has a sportsteam nicknamed Bobcats). The point is, the picture does not evoke any emotions with me. All I see is three people on a couch, wearing similar clothes, probably fanwear, and looking slightly uncomfortable. The lighting is quite harsh, the picture is not very sharp and the woman''s eyes look like you''ve corrected for red eyes in PP (either that, or she''s on something). All in all, I see a group portrait, but not a very good one. (4)', '2007-10-05 10:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143841, 592842, 70689, '<td valign="top">Lovely, almost classical group portrait. Group composition is very good, sharpness, colors and contrast are fine. I would have liked a slightly shallower DOF, and a little more precission in dodging and burning. (7)</td>', 'Lovely, almost classical group portrait. Group composition is very good, sharpness, colors and contrast are fine. I would have liked a slightly shallower DOF, and a little more precission in dodging and burning. (7)', '2007-10-05 11:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143881, 593636, 76430, '<td valign="top">Composed well.  Good vantage point.  Half-way through a marathon I would hate to admit I was behind some running flowers.</td>', 'Composed well.  Good vantage point.  Half-way through a marathon I would hate to admit I was behind some running flowers.', '2007-10-05 11:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143890, 592397, 76430, '<td valign="top">Everybody is NEVER ready when you have a bunch of kids.  Cute expressions on everyone''s faces.</td>', 'Everybody is NEVER ready when you have a bunch of kids.  Cute expressions on everyone''s faces.', '2007-10-05 11:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143935, 594156, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like Torrey Pines in San Diego.  Great capture, but I don''t know if it''s oversharpened or what but the lines are too fractured.  I wouldn''t call it a portrait.</td>', 'It looks like Torrey Pines in San Diego.  Great capture, but I don''t know if it''s oversharpened or what but the lines are too fractured.  I wouldn''t call it a portrait.', '2007-10-05 11:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143966, 594451, 70689, '<td valign="top">Cool concept, and yes, I understand that dark fits the concept. Still, the three dark t-shirts melt into one big lump. But otherwise, it''s cool (8)</td>', 'Cool concept, and yes, I understand that dark fits the concept. Still, the three dark t-shirts melt into one big lump. But otherwise, it''s cool (8)', '2007-10-05 11:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4143993, 593813, 70689, '<td valign="top">The blessed father of three such pretty girls (his wife is probably gorgeous) has rough times ahead in a couple of years. ;)<br/> <br/>But on the picture: The picture has ribbon potential. Not only because of the subject, but because it depicts the beauty of the girls so well. The sunlight on the hairs is great, while keeping sufficient light on the faces (fill in flash I presume?). Great bokeh in the back. Minor points include some shadows on the middle girl and the crop (too wide imo) on the left. And in my opinion, it''s a tad too sweet, but that''s merely a matter of taste. (8)</td>', 'The blessed father of three such pretty girls (his wife is probably gorgeous) has rough times ahead in a couple of years. ;) But on the picture: The picture has ribbon potential. Not only because of the subject, but because it depicts the beauty of the girls so well. The sunlight on the hairs is great, while keeping sufficient light on the faces (fill in flash I presume?). Great bokeh in the back. Minor points include some shadows on the middle girl and the crop (too wide imo) on the left. And in my opinion, it''s a tad too sweet, but that''s merely a matter of taste. (8)', '2007-10-05 11:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144003, 594669, 70689, '<td valign="top">Is this a group portrait? I''dd rather lable it a picture of photogs in action. And each of these photogs probably made a better picture because they were much closer on the subject, capturing the emotions. This pic is way too chaotic for my taste (4)</td>', 'Is this a group portrait? I''dd rather lable it a picture of photogs in action. And each of these photogs probably made a better picture because they were much closer on the subject, capturing the emotions. This pic is way too chaotic for my taste (4)', '2007-10-05 11:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144012, 594202, 14437, '<td valign="top">Wow, I would say that this shot is great. I like the composition, and the way you balanced your models in a symmetry pattern. 8 from me.</td>', 'Wow, I would say that this shot is great. I like the composition, and the way you balanced your models in a symmetry pattern. 8 from me.', '2007-10-05 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144014, 593010, 14437, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. This shot deserve a 10!</td>', 'I really like this shot. This shot deserve a 10!', '2007-10-05 11:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144019, 593813, 14437, '<td valign="top">So sweet, so beautiful!</td>', 'So sweet, so beautiful!', '2007-10-05 11:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144021, 594801, 14437, '<td valign="top">This is creative.</td>', 'This is creative.', '2007-10-05 11:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144317, 594146, 30049, '<td valign="top">ewwwww - Democrats!</td>', 'ewwwww - Democrats!', '2007-10-05 13:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144429, 594377, 54540, '<td valign="top">Good family group shot.  Additional fill flash to light the subjects would help light the faces even more, they are a bit too shaded still for my tastes.<br/>The expression on the little ones face is precious.</td>', 'Good family group shot.  Additional fill flash to light the subjects would help light the faces even more, they are a bit too shaded still for my tastes.The expression on the little ones face is precious.', '2007-10-05 14:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144435, 594805, 54540, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea for the challenge!<br/>This would be interesting to see with some additional lighting on the front of the hands, perhaps from below, to help highlight the skin textures?</td>', 'A very clever idea for the challenge!This would be interesting to see with some additional lighting on the front of the hands, perhaps from below, to help highlight the skin textures?', '2007-10-05 14:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144436, 594202, 70689, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Would have been even better if you sticked closer to the original. Nevertheless, this is a very good picture. Great lighting and a clear focus on ''Jesus'', without ignoring the others. (9)</td>', 'I like the idea. Would have been even better if you sticked closer to the original. Nevertheless, this is a very good picture. Great lighting and a clear focus on ''Jesus'', without ignoring the others. (9)', '2007-10-05 14:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144449, 594816, 32968, '<td valign="top">You may be surrounded but you''re the first one I noticed! Nice shot. You''re a bit dark (pardon the pun) but I guess it suits the mood in the bottom half of the photo. An "airy" mood above and a "heavy" one below. A juxtaposition of moods :) Holy big words! I think I would''ve left just a bit more of you in the lower half, but the way it is certainly does make it looks like you''re being overwhelmed by blondness! 7</td>', 'You may be surrounded but you''re the first one I noticed! Nice shot. You''re a bit dark (pardon the pun) but I guess it suits the mood in the bottom half of the photo. An "airy" mood above and a "heavy" one below. A juxtaposition of moods :) Holy big words! I think I would''ve left just a bit more of you in the lower half, but the way it is certainly does make it looks like you''re being overwhelmed by blondness! 7', '2007-10-05 14:20:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4144451, 592680, 70689, '<td valign="top">owch, the white hurts my eyes. Especially the blouse of the army lady is totaly blown out. Lighting on their faces is pretty hars too, as are the shadows of the air force lady. Please devote some more attention to lighting next time, try using some diffusion material (a tissue will do) or apply indirect lighting (4)</td>', 'owch, the white hurts my eyes. Especially the blouse of the army lady is totaly blown out. Lighting on their faces is pretty hars too, as are the shadows of the air force lady. Please devote some more attention to lighting next time, try using some diffusion material (a tissue will do) or apply indirect lighting (4)', '2007-10-05 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4144484, 594187, 70689, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it. That doesn''t mean it''s a bad photo, but it does mean you are not conveying your message to at least one viewer. My main problem with the picture is that ''feels'' terribly tilted. Furthermore, there is quite some distraction in the background. (4)</td>', 'I don''t get it. That doesn''t mean it''s a bad photo, but it does mean you are not conveying your message to at least one viewer. My main problem with the picture is that ''feels'' terribly tilted. Furthermore, there is quite some distraction in the background. (4)', '2007-10-05 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
