(4145001, 594202, 68035, '<td valign="top">Oh my word I can only begin to guess at some of the comments (and votes) that this picture will have generated for you<br/> <br/>OK from my perspective<br/> <br/>Are you a blasphemer? - No<br/>Is this offensive - Not to me<br/>Is it attractive - Not to me (but I am not a big fan of tattoos)<br/>Is it a good idea - Hmmmmm possibly a little cliched in the big wide world but a very good concept for this challenge<br/>Is it well executed - Pretty much so<br/>Is it well composed - Yes<br/> <br/>All things considered I give it a 7.  Hope you feel the comment is fair</td>', 'Oh my word I can only begin to guess at some of the comments (and votes) that this picture will have generated for you OK from my perspective Are you a blasphemer? - NoIs this offensive - Not to meIs it attractive - Not to me (but I am not a big fan of tattoos)Is it a good idea - Hmmmmm possibly a little cliched in the big wide world but a very good concept for this challengeIs it well executed - Pretty much soIs it well composed - Yes All things considered I give it a 7.  Hope you feel the comment is fair', '2007-10-05 16:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
