(4146111, 594202, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely spectacular entry. It is probably one of the best efforts I have seen in the little over a year since I''ve been here. I would like to give this a 12 or 13, but that isn''t possible. I am just so impressed at the amazing convergence of so many messages. A true work of art.....I am totally in awe! 10 10 10 10 10 10</td>', 'This is an absolutely spectacular entry. It is probably one of the best efforts I have seen in the little over a year since I''ve been here. I would like to give this a 12 or 13, but that isn''t possible. I am just so impressed at the amazing convergence of so many messages. A true work of art.....I am totally in awe! 10 10 10 10 10 10', '2007-10-05 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
