(4146886, 594669, 63244, '<td valign="top">To me, this is more snapshotish (is that a word??). Perhaps cropping on a smaller group would be more appealing to me. (Roughly bottom left corner 2/3s?) Having said that, your colors are amazing and I like the bit of backlighting that appears in spots. Great focus and dof in the shot! Still very nice! 5</td>', 'To me, this is more snapshotish (is that a word??). Perhaps cropping on a smaller group would be more appealing to me. (Roughly bottom left corner 2/3s?) Having said that, your colors are amazing and I like the bit of backlighting that appears in spots. Great focus and dof in the shot! Still very nice! 5', '2007-10-06 10:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
