(4146897, 594801, 63244, '<td valign="top">I picked this out as a thumb!! Darling capture and a very creative use of lighting and model posing. I like this crop (socks, tiles, shirts and hair are all tonally in synch!). Would also like to see a tighter crop without floor and feet. Might have an even more powerful effect, if that''s possible. One of my favs in this challenge!! Should ribbon IMO.</td>', 'I picked this out as a thumb!! Darling capture and a very creative use of lighting and model posing. I like this crop (socks, tiles, shirts and hair are all tonally in synch!). Would also like to see a tighter crop without floor and feet. Might have an even more powerful effect, if that''s possible. One of my favs in this challenge!! Should ribbon IMO.', '2007-10-06 10:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4146903, 594740, 63244, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and posing. I even like the somewhat small color range. My only nit is the light glare on the sunglasses and the man''s forhead. (Powder) :D This is an appealing shot.</td>', 'Excellent focus and posing. I even like the somewhat small color range. My only nit is the light glare on the sunglasses and the man''s forhead. (Powder) :D This is an appealing shot.', '2007-10-06 10:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
