(4146921, 593380, 63244, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s a treatment or an overlay...but it''s different. Not sure if I like it. It does give the photograph a more "drawing" rather than "photo" feel, but I keep wanting to see the facial details more. It almost seems to must e the colors a bit too much IMO. This is a very different idea. 6</td>', 'Not sure if it''s a treatment or an overlay...but it''s different. Not sure if I like it. It does give the photograph a more "drawing" rather than "photo" feel, but I keep wanting to see the facial details more. It almost seems to must e the colors a bit too much IMO. This is a very different idea. 6', '2007-10-06 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
