(4148587, 593815, 70689, '<td valign="top">Lighting and setup are fine, the picture has got a very professional look. This will probably be a very dear picture to the mother and wife of this family (and to dad as well), but it does not touch me. Therefore, the 7 points I am giving is based solely on technical quality,</td>', 'Lighting and setup are fine, the picture has got a very professional look. This will probably be a very dear picture to the mother and wife of this family (and to dad as well), but it does not touch me. Therefore, the 7 points I am giving is based solely on technical quality,', '2007-10-07 03:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4148595, 593922, 70689, '<td valign="top">hmmm, picture does not realy appeal to me. Although the composition is quite nice, I dilsike looking at backs and the blown out highlights in the picture. The bright thing on the left is very discturbing: it draws away the attention from the group and does not seem to add anything to the picture.</td>', 'hmmm, picture does not realy appeal to me. Although the composition is quite nice, I dilsike looking at backs and the blown out highlights in the picture. The bright thing on the left is very discturbing: it draws away the attention from the group and does not seem to add anything to the picture.', '2007-10-07 03:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
