(4151514, 594202, 40580, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like the lighting and the contrast with the bad-boy types playing Jesus and apostles.  Of course, Jesus was a rebel and did hang out with different types of people.<br/> <br/>I would''ve liked a cropping of the top making it more short and long like the last supper picture I normally see.<br/> <br/>Good Luck.  I''m giving you high scores.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like the lighting and the contrast with the bad-boy types playing Jesus and apostles.  Of course, Jesus was a rebel and did hang out with different types of people. I would''ve liked a cropping of the top making it more short and long like the last supper picture I normally see. Good Luck.  I''m giving you high scores.', '2007-10-08 10:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151525, 594819, 40580, '<td valign="top">I like the dark and green tone to this picture.  Could be seen in an album cover.<br/> <br/>There is no connection between the viewer (me) and this picture.  Of course, there is nothing I can say to help you (since I have no clue how to get that connection).  I''m still giving you an above average score for this one.<br/> <br/>Good Luck.</td>', 'I like the dark and green tone to this picture.  Could be seen in an album cover. There is no connection between the viewer (me) and this picture.  Of course, there is nothing I can say to help you (since I have no clue how to get that connection).  I''m still giving you an above average score for this one. Good Luck.', '2007-10-08 10:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151538, 592680, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice snap shot.<br/> <br/>I''ll bet you''ve read this before, but the lighting looks like a single source and is your main light.  Not too flattering.  Would be better to get the light source up and a way from the camera.  Basically practice more with your flash, or don''t use it at all.</td>', 'Nice snap shot. I''ll bet you''ve read this before, but the lighting looks like a single source and is your main light.  Not too flattering.  Would be better to get the light source up and a way from the camera.  Basically practice more with your flash, or don''t use it at all.', '2007-10-08 11:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151552, 593892, 40580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  <br/> <br/>I really like the expression on the girl on the right.  It could be a nice smile, or a look of "I''m up to trouble and know it."  Plus, for some reason, the lighting''s smoother on her face.  Your wife and littlest have shinny skin.  I thought the only way to do this was with makeup.<br/> <br/>I also like the way they are grouped with the youngest on the bottom and your wife on top.<br/> <br/>Good luck.  I''m giving you top scores.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.   I really like the expression on the girl on the right.  It could be a nice smile, or a look of "I''m up to trouble and know it."  Plus, for some reason, the lighting''s smoother on her face.  Your wife and littlest have shinny skin.  I thought the only way to do this was with makeup. I also like the way they are grouped with the youngest on the bottom and your wife on top. Good luck.  I''m giving you top scores.', '2007-10-08 11:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151558, 594516, 40580, '<td valign="top">I like the grain/noise in this shot.  I also like the expressions on each of their faces.  Their faces each say something different.  The title also sets the tone nicely.<br/> <br/>I have nothing to add to help you with this.  I''m giving you top scores.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'I like the grain/noise in this shot.  I also like the expressions on each of their faces.  Their faces each say something different.  The title also sets the tone nicely. I have nothing to add to help you with this.  I''m giving you top scores. Good luck.', '2007-10-08 11:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151566, 594377, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.<br/> <br/>Your subjects look a little out of focus tho.  Maybe the focus is good, but my attention is drawn to the background instead of your subjects.  Since the viewer''s eyes are drawn to the most lit areas, your intended subject (the people) don''t become the main focus.<br/> <br/>Of course, if that was your intent (have the backgroud brighter than your subject), then please disregard.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot. Your subjects look a little out of focus tho.  Maybe the focus is good, but my attention is drawn to the background instead of your subjects.  Since the viewer''s eyes are drawn to the most lit areas, your intended subject (the people) don''t become the main focus. Of course, if that was your intent (have the backgroud brighter than your subject), then please disregard. Good luck.', '2007-10-08 11:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151567, 594736, 40580, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.<br/> <br/>Another picture had the same problem this one does (and beach pictures are hard to do because of this).  The background is lit better than your subjects (the people).  Your subject have some pretty harsh shadows.<br/> <br/>Check out some tips on taking <a href="//www.google.com/search?hl=en&amp;q=taking+beach+pictures" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">beach pictures</a>.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Nice picture. Another picture had the same problem this one does (and beach pictures are hard to do because of this).  The background is lit better than your subjects (the people).  Your subject have some pretty harsh shadows. Check out some tips on taking beach pictures. Good luck.', '2007-10-08 11:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4151572, 594816, 40580, '<td valign="top">Wow, powerful shot.  I really like the contrast between the blondes and the non-blonde.  I''m really drawn to the non-blonde''s eyes since there''s a great contrast between the smiling (blonde) faces and the dark stare of the non-blonde.<br/> <br/>Well done and I hope others get the shot.</td>', 'Wow, powerful shot.  I really like the contrast between the blondes and the non-blonde.  I''m really drawn to the non-blonde''s eyes since there''s a great contrast between the smiling (blonde) faces and the dark stare of the non-blonde. Well done and I hope others get the shot.', '2007-10-08 11:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
