(4152359, 594736, 3746, '<td valign="top">this would of been better cropped a bit closer. Also, a wee bit more fill in flash would of been beneficial or maybe using a reflector. 6</td>', 'this would of been better cropped a bit closer. Also, a wee bit more fill in flash would of been beneficial or maybe using a reflector. 6', '2007-10-08 18:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152377, 594649, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, this is a really fun shot, well directed and executed BUT using sepia has not added to this shot in anyway. Sepia is usually used to add a timeless quality to a shot, here I would of opted for loud garish colours to enhance the fun factor..  Still, as a large print this would be great for any member of that family so dont be downhearted by the 6 I give here, to the family here it is probably worth a million at least... well done..</td>', 'OK, this is a really fun shot, well directed and executed BUT using sepia has not added to this shot in anyway. Sepia is usually used to add a timeless quality to a shot, here I would of opted for loud garish colours to enhance the fun factor..  Still, as a large print this would be great for any member of that family so dont be downhearted by the 6 I give here, to the family here it is probably worth a million at least... well done..', '2007-10-08 18:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152380, 593892, 3746, '<td valign="top">An OK portrait, does everything by the book, would been nice to see them ina more natural pose, playing, laughing, joking hugging.. this whole look is very `80s`. Also, I am not liking the space to the left and right, would of been better witha tighter crop.. 6</td>', 'An OK portrait, does everything by the book, would been nice to see them ina more natural pose, playing, laughing, joking hugging.. this whole look is very `80s`. Also, I am not liking the space to the left and right, would of been better witha tighter crop.. 6', '2007-10-08 18:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152385, 594670, 3746, '<td valign="top">nice shot.. goes beyond a basic holiday snap, would of benefitted from a tighter crop, maybe take a bit of that sky out from above them, maybe you tried it and it didnt work for you.. overall a pretty solid entry.. good luck.. 7</td>', 'nice shot.. goes beyond a basic holiday snap, would of benefitted from a tighter crop, maybe take a bit of that sky out from above them, maybe you tried it and it didnt work for you.. overall a pretty solid entry.. good luck.. 7', '2007-10-08 18:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152388, 593790, 3746, '<td valign="top">slightly different to the entries I have viewed so far.. nice natural fun shot, even in this `posed` configuration.. nice use of fill-in here.. well done. 7</td>', 'slightly different to the entries I have viewed so far.. nice natural fun shot, even in this `posed` configuration.. nice use of fill-in here.. well done. 7', '2007-10-08 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152392, 593108, 3746, '<td valign="top">strong shot. obviously was in the right place at the right time. But that pink border aint working against the green grass.. I would of opted for white or maybe black..  great shot though and will strike the right chord with alot of people.. 6</td>', 'strong shot. obviously was in the right place at the right time. But that pink border aint working against the green grass.. I would of opted for white or maybe black..  great shot though and will strike the right chord with alot of people.. 6', '2007-10-08 18:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152396, 594358, 3746, '<td valign="top">LOL, a scene I see week after week when I shoot weddings. However, poor focus or maybe a slow shutter hasnt helped matters here.. tweaking the white balance a little bit would of bought out the more natural colours. Quite a flat feeling image and not really a group portrait, more like a group candid.  so so in my book. 5</td>', 'LOL, a scene I see week after week when I shoot weddings. However, poor focus or maybe a slow shutter hasnt helped matters here.. tweaking the white balance a little bit would of bought out the more natural colours. Quite a flat feeling image and not really a group portrait, more like a group candid.  so so in my book. 5', '2007-10-08 18:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152403, 594741, 3746, '<td valign="top">quite a fun shot. Not overly keen on the BW conversion you have got going on here, would of been nicer with a bit more contrast. Try using the channel mixer to convert shots to BW, this has a feel of a "convert mode to grayscale". not a bad effort, I''d expect this to finish mid-table somewhere. 6</td>', 'quite a fun shot. Not overly keen on the BW conversion you have got going on here, would of been nicer with a bit more contrast. Try using the channel mixer to convert shots to BW, this has a feel of a "convert mode to grayscale". not a bad effort, I''d expect this to finish mid-table somewhere. 6', '2007-10-08 18:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152406, 594801, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK am liking this one, the lighting from above works very well. Pity about the tiles on the floor they are quite distracting, but on this occasion I am willing to ignore them and concentrate on the image as a whole.. working well for me here. 8</td>', 'OK am liking this one, the lighting from above works very well. Pity about the tiles on the floor they are quite distracting, but on this occasion I am willing to ignore them and concentrate on the image as a whole.. working well for me here. 8', '2007-10-08 18:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152408, 594902, 3746, '<td valign="top">Not really striking me as a group portrait, more like a group candid, I wont say DNMC, but its bordering on that.. still, a good shot and interesting angle.. 6</td>', 'Not really striking me as a group portrait, more like a group candid, I wont say DNMC, but its bordering on that.. still, a good shot and interesting angle.. 6', '2007-10-08 18:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152411, 592842, 3746, '<td valign="top">I am not digging the moody look on the kids faces, kids are supposed to be full of fun and frivolity, not looking as though they are in a police line-up. post-processing looks a bit harsh to me. 6</td>', 'I am not digging the moody look on the kids faces, kids are supposed to be full of fun and frivolity, not looking as though they are in a police line-up. post-processing looks a bit harsh to me. 6', '2007-10-08 18:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152415, 594199, 3746, '<td valign="top">Far too much processing here makes the kids skin look very plasticy. I will up you a point or two for doing what a lot of people here forgot to do and that is crop in nice and tight, you did a good job here and managed to omit most of the distracting background. Overall this deserves a 6 - I''d expect this to finish around the mid-table mark.</td>', 'Far too much processing here makes the kids skin look very plasticy. I will up you a point or two for doing what a lot of people here forgot to do and that is crop in nice and tight, you did a good job here and managed to omit most of the distracting background. Overall this deserves a 6 - I''d expect this to finish around the mid-table mark.', '2007-10-08 18:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152417, 594158, 3746, '<td valign="top">Wooohoooo, now I cant have a go here about shoe-horning this shot into the challenge as I have done that with my "searching" entry this week. However, this isnt really a portrait, I wont say DNMC (although it is borderline) I would class this more as Group Candid. Not bad overall. 6<br/> <br/>as a subnote - the way that shoulder of the person behind the bride protrudes from her chest makes it look like she has HUGE busswabs. :)</td>', 'Wooohoooo, now I cant have a go here about shoe-horning this shot into the challenge as I have done that with my "searching" entry this week. However, this isnt really a portrait, I wont say DNMC (although it is borderline) I would class this more as Group Candid. Not bad overall. 6 as a subnote - the way that shoulder of the person behind the bride protrudes from her chest makes it look like she has HUGE busswabs. :)', '2007-10-08 18:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152431, 592397, 3746, '<td valign="top">Quite harsh processing here.. using a wider aperature to blur the background a bit would of seperated the subjects from the BG a little.  not really breathtaking. 4</td>', 'Quite harsh processing here.. using a wider aperature to blur the background a bit would of seperated the subjects from the BG a little.  not really breathtaking. 4', '2007-10-08 18:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152432, 592680, 3746, '<td valign="top">well, I guess it is a portrait, but to me it seems no effort was made to make it a great shot, more of a snapshot. Grainy, harsh direct flash lighting.. not very good at all I am afraid.. 4</td>', 'well, I guess it is a portrait, but to me it seems no effort was made to make it a great shot, more of a snapshot. Grainy, harsh direct flash lighting.. not very good at all I am afraid.. 4', '2007-10-08 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
