(4152472, 594819, 3746, '<td valign="top">Lets get the bad stuff out of the way first. I am not liking the green tint and would of liked to see the exposure upped a wee bit. However, now onto the good.<br/> <br/>Composition is spot on, nice tight cropping has worked well here, a lot of shots in this challenge have left far too much negative space around the sides of the image.  <br/> <br/>The models are nicely posed , I take it this is a band promo shot.. so, sort out the green tint, brighten it up and bit and it would be great... giving this a 7</td>', 'Lets get the bad stuff out of the way first. I am not liking the green tint and would of liked to see the exposure upped a wee bit. However, now onto the good. Composition is spot on, nice tight cropping has worked well here, a lot of shots in this challenge have left far too much negative space around the sides of the image.   The models are nicely posed , I take it this is a band promo shot.. so, sort out the green tint, brighten it up and bit and it would be great... giving this a 7', '2007-10-08 19:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152474, 594611, 3746, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, sets it apart from the stand police lineup shots poeple have entered (when they havent entered candids).  This shots meets all the technicals and looks good to boot.. 7  - well done.</td>', 'Nice idea, sets it apart from the stand police lineup shots poeple have entered (when they havent entered candids).  This shots meets all the technicals and looks good to boot.. 7  - well done.', '2007-10-08 19:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
