(4152501, 594692, 3746, '<td valign="top">Wooohoo. OK, I think you have heard this a lot already, but I think I am looking at a top 5 shot here, I am only halfway through voting so I will reserve judgement, but I cannot fault this shot.<br/> <br/>It is not candid (its more editorial) so it defintely fits into the portrait catagory - the colours are gorgeous, the yellow in the background really works against the outfits of the dancers.  I love a shot with a nice bokeh''d background and this is perfect.<br/> <br/>nothing I can add here. Cant wait to see whose it is.<br/> <br/>10 and fav''d. well done..</td>', 'Wooohoo. OK, I think you have heard this a lot already, but I think I am looking at a top 5 shot here, I am only halfway through voting so I will reserve judgement, but I cannot fault this shot. It is not candid (its more editorial) so it defintely fits into the portrait catagory - the colours are gorgeous, the yellow in the background really works against the outfits of the dancers.  I love a shot with a nice bokeh''d background and this is perfect. nothing I can add here. Cant wait to see whose it is. 10 and fav''d. well done..', '2007-10-08 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
