(4152517, 594833, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, thank god for whoever shot this.. Its so nice to see a bit of effort put into a shot to make it a real portrait unlike a lot of the candids we have in this challenge. I like the (projected?) background. The BW conversion is second to none and is what makes this photo for me. The models do a solid job in their roles. I am thinking this could be an idnic shot as she (you?) generally put a bit of effort into your studio shots. if not, take that as a compliment!!<br/> <br/>9 and well done from me..</td>', 'OK, thank god for whoever shot this.. Its so nice to see a bit of effort put into a shot to make it a real portrait unlike a lot of the candids we have in this challenge. I like the (projected?) background. The BW conversion is second to none and is what makes this photo for me. The models do a solid job in their roles. I am thinking this could be an idnic shot as she (you?) generally put a bit of effort into your studio shots. if not, take that as a compliment!! 9 and well done from me..', '2007-10-08 19:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
