(4152550, 592458, 3746, '<td valign="top">snapshot, but I guess it just manages to drag itself into portrait territory. nothing to write home about here.  below average. 5</td>', 'snapshot, but I guess it just manages to drag itself into portrait territory. nothing to write home about here.  below average. 5', '2007-10-08 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152566, 594451, 3746, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmm. OK. some good things with this image and a couple of tiny niggles. Lets start with the niggles.<br/> <br/>The t-shirts - I would of loved to see plain black here, the logos from the `triumph` tee and the `Harry Potter` Tee are quite distracting, the little guy on the left has his coverd, so not as distracting.  Thats all though.. Oh, and maybe lining up the eyes on all the models, but I am being pedantic now. ignore me..<br/> <br/>Now, I like the composition, not cropped too tightly or too much space left around the edges. The colour is great, quite dark and moody but works with the backdrop.  Lighting is good and not just slapped into the scene, a bit of though has been put in there.. The concept of the photo as a whole works well. The title compliments the shot here, it doesnt drive it. <br/> <br/>overall a good solid shot, maybe not a ribbon winner, but certainly a top ten (if there is any justice).  I am  gonna drop you an 8 here, would of been a 9 but finding those tee''s a bit distracting still. well done!!</td>', 'Hmmmmmm. OK. some good things with this image and a couple of tiny niggles. Lets start with the niggles. The t-shirts - I would of loved to see plain black here, the logos from the `triumph` tee and the `Harry Potter` Tee are quite distracting, the little guy on the left has his coverd, so not as distracting.  Thats all though.. Oh, and maybe lining up the eyes on all the models, but I am being pedantic now. ignore me.. Now, I like the composition, not cropped too tightly or too much space left around the edges. The colour is great, quite dark and moody but works with the backdrop.  Lighting is good and not just slapped into the scene, a bit of though has been put in there.. The concept of the photo as a whole works well. The title compliments the shot here, it doesnt drive it.  overall a good solid shot, maybe not a ribbon winner, but certainly a top ten (if there is any justice).  I am  gonna drop you an 8 here, would of been a 9 but finding those tee''s a bit distracting still. well done!!', '2007-10-08 19:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152567, 594410, 3746, '<td valign="top">dull boring snapshot, not even sure why you bothered to convert to BW.. 3</td>', 'dull boring snapshot, not even sure why you bothered to convert to BW.. 3', '2007-10-08 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152570, 594805, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, its nice to see someone thinkging OOTB, but it aint doing it for me here, call me a traditionalist, but in group portraits I like to see a few faces in there.. 6</td>', 'OK, its nice to see someone thinkging OOTB, but it aint doing it for me here, call me a traditionalist, but in group portraits I like to see a few faces in there.. 6', '2007-10-08 19:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152582, 594669, 3746, '<td valign="top">This isnt really a portrait is it?? I will say its a great image, but doesnt really belong here in this challenge, thus I am gonna mark you down.. sorry.. nice shot though.</td>', 'This isnt really a portrait is it?? I will say its a great image, but doesnt really belong here in this challenge, thus I am gonna mark you down.. sorry.. nice shot though.', '2007-10-08 19:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152585, 594202, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, this is just great, nicely lit, well posed..  probably a theatre group or something right??  whatever, meets the technicals, slightly quirky, good shot.. I bet 640 pixels doesnt do it any justice.. 9 all the way and a top 5 finish at least.</td>', 'OK, this is just great, nicely lit, well posed..  probably a theatre group or something right??  whatever, meets the technicals, slightly quirky, good shot.. I bet 640 pixels doesnt do it any justice.. 9 all the way and a top 5 finish at least.', '2007-10-08 19:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
