(4152607, 594664, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, I would love you to PM me and tell me how this meets the challenge.. I reckon you are shooting for the brown deliberately.. truely dull and inspiring.. 2</td>', 'OK, I would love you to PM me and tell me how this meets the challenge.. I reckon you are shooting for the brown deliberately.. truely dull and inspiring.. 2', '2007-10-08 19:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4152610, 594862, 3746, '<td valign="top">woohoo, what a great photo.. I reckon we could be seeing this on the frontpage sometime soon.. has all the hallmarks of a scalvert image  (poor lighting and no flash post-processing effects), but what it lacks in technical flashery it more than makes up for in inventiveness, execution and just being so darned good.. a really fun shot that made me smile whilst sitting here. and I am a miserable git so that really is something.<br/> <br/>brilliant!  9</td>', 'woohoo, what a great photo.. I reckon we could be seeing this on the frontpage sometime soon.. has all the hallmarks of a scalvert image  (poor lighting and no flash post-processing effects), but what it lacks in technical flashery it more than makes up for in inventiveness, execution and just being so darned good.. a really fun shot that made me smile whilst sitting here. and I am a miserable git so that really is something. brilliant!  9', '2007-10-08 19:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
