(4153320, 594803, 74741, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge, but since you lost the bet I guess you don''t care.  Ha Ha</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge, but since you lost the bet I guess you don''t care.  Ha Ha', '2007-10-08 23:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153453, 593016, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like the pentagon shape made by the heads. Focus is good enough at all depths, and Judi''s red hair really pops out to complement all the pink.</td>', 'I like the pentagon shape made by the heads. Focus is good enough at all depths, and Judi''s red hair really pops out to complement all the pink.', '2007-10-09 00:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153457, 594265, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast throughout, but a bit hectic; I don''t know where to look (and I certainly don''t know who the "guide" is).</td>', 'Nice contrast throughout, but a bit hectic; I don''t know where to look (and I certainly don''t know who the "guide" is).', '2007-10-09 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153464, 592589, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great composition and timing. The oversaturation sort of works here.</td>', 'Great composition and timing. The oversaturation sort of works here.', '2007-10-09 00:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153468, 593636, 57032, '<td valign="top">The fact that they''re all running in the same direction--and well spaced apart--helps prevent this image from being too cluttered. The ground serves as a great backdrop. Nice timing with the sunflowers--makes for a good composition.</td>', 'The fact that they''re all running in the same direction--and well spaced apart--helps prevent this image from being too cluttered. The ground serves as a great backdrop. Nice timing with the sunflowers--makes for a good composition.', '2007-10-09 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153472, 594620, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like this perspective (I do this with bridal parties), and I don''t mind the blown highlights here. I don''t know how it would look in print, but I like the shot here. I would''ve gotten rid of the camera on the bottom, though (distracting).</td>', 'I like this perspective (I do this with bridal parties), and I don''t mind the blown highlights here. I don''t know how it would look in print, but I like the shot here. I would''ve gotten rid of the camera on the bottom, though (distracting).', '2007-10-09 00:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153474, 594803, 43031, '<td valign="top">DNMC - HAH!</td>', 'DNMC - HAH!', '2007-10-09 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153481, 594158, 57032, '<td valign="top">The exposure is handled well here. Good timing, for a great expression on their faces.</td>', 'The exposure is handled well here. Good timing, for a great expression on their faces.', '2007-10-09 00:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153486, 594698, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great timing and nice diagonal composition. Since the flash didn''t reach the bottom of the image, I might have added a vignette to "hide" what is otherwise slightly distracting. The girl in the back has very cute eyes, and it''s not necessary to see any more of her face.</td>', 'Great timing and nice diagonal composition. Since the flash didn''t reach the bottom of the image, I might have added a vignette to "hide" what is otherwise slightly distracting. The girl in the back has very cute eyes, and it''s not necessary to see any more of her face.', '2007-10-09 00:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153490, 594670, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the background, and the brightness helps separate it from the subjects. Perhaps a bit more fill light would have gotten rid of most of the "eye socket" effect.</td>', 'Nice colours in the background, and the brightness helps separate it from the subjects. Perhaps a bit more fill light would have gotten rid of most of the "eye socket" effect.', '2007-10-09 00:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153491, 594643, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice expressions and the contrast is good.</td>', 'Nice expressions and the contrast is good.', '2007-10-09 00:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153493, 594889, 57032, '<td valign="top">The fact that he''s the only one looking in a different direction helps, but there''s not much done here to make the subject stand out. The image is quite cluttered with people, and the subject''s face is dark and not in crisp focus. Perhaps some dodging and burning--along with selective blurring and focusing--would have helped the subject pop out more.</td>', 'The fact that he''s the only one looking in a different direction helps, but there''s not much done here to make the subject stand out. The image is quite cluttered with people, and the subject''s face is dark and not in crisp focus. Perhaps some dodging and burning--along with selective blurring and focusing--would have helped the subject pop out more.', '2007-10-09 00:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153498, 594595, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting posing and subjects. Facial expressions are good.</td>', 'Interesting posing and subjects. Facial expressions are good.', '2007-10-09 00:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153499, 594751, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good angle and nicely composed.</td>', 'Good angle and nicely composed.', '2007-10-09 00:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153501, 593922, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot. Black and white looks good here. Very well composed.</td>', 'Great candid shot. Black and white looks good here. Very well composed.', '2007-10-09 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153527, 594902, 57032, '<td valign="top">The perspective is a fresh one, and the honeycomb pattern serves as an interesting background.</td>', 'The perspective is a fresh one, and the honeycomb pattern serves as an interesting background.', '2007-10-09 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153542, 594872, 57032, '<td valign="top">A group portrait, surely, but there''s no clear subject among them all (and the group as a whole doesn''t serve as a single subject, as the eye easily drifts away from it).<br/> <br/>If I may, I would suggest a tighter crop on only a few of the musicians, in a nice black and white. The brain is surprisingly good at completing the picture, and it doesn''t require seeing the entire orchestra to know that everyone''s there.</td>', 'A group portrait, surely, but there''s no clear subject among them all (and the group as a whole doesn''t serve as a single subject, as the eye easily drifts away from it). If I may, I would suggest a tighter crop on only a few of the musicians, in a nice black and white. The brain is surprisingly good at completing the picture, and it doesn''t require seeing the entire orchestra to know that everyone''s there.', '2007-10-09 00:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153543, 592397, 57032, '<td valign="top">Cute expressions on many of them, and the title helps, but the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Cute expressions on many of them, and the title helps, but the background is a bit distracting.', '2007-10-09 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153547, 593815, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes, but the man''s face looks posterized. Perhaps I''m wrong, but the faces look over-processed.</td>', 'Nice eyes, but the man''s face looks posterized. Perhaps I''m wrong, but the faces look over-processed.', '2007-10-09 00:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153548, 593813, 57032, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, and nice job using the sun for backlighting. Great exposure.</td>', 'Great eyes, and nice job using the sun for backlighting. Great exposure.', '2007-10-09 00:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153571, 593599, 57032, '<td valign="top">You met the challenge by including the parents on the right, but the image as it exists here is quite cluttered and distracting to me. The pinks in the blanket and pants, along with the tennis racquets and the plastic bag, do nothing to help the image.<br/> <br/>I would suggest taking a tight crop of the girl and doe she''s feeding, and converting that to black and white or sepia tone. Judging by the look and posing of the girl relative to the deer, I think you''d have an excellent shot in your portfolio.</td>', 'You met the challenge by including the parents on the right, but the image as it exists here is quite cluttered and distracting to me. The pinks in the blanket and pants, along with the tennis racquets and the plastic bag, do nothing to help the image. I would suggest taking a tight crop of the girl and doe she''s feeding, and converting that to black and white or sepia tone. Judging by the look and posing of the girl relative to the deer, I think you''d have an excellent shot in your portfolio.', '2007-10-09 01:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153581, 592680, 57032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the underexposed background screams "on-board flash". There look to be a lot of JPEG artifacts here; when I go to download this image, it comes up at only 36 kb, and yet you could have saved it at 150 kb.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the underexposed background screams "on-board flash". There look to be a lot of JPEG artifacts here; when I go to download this image, it comes up at only 36 kb, and yet you could have saved it at 150 kb.', '2007-10-09 01:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153586, 594856, 57032, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit plasticky (especially in the trees), and there''s an odd black halo around the girl''s head. If the image is going to be blurred, it would''ve been nice if the ball had a motion blur and looked like it was moving toward the man.</td>', 'Looks a bit plasticky (especially in the trees), and there''s an odd black halo around the girl''s head. If the image is going to be blurred, it would''ve been nice if the ball had a motion blur and looked like it was moving toward the man.', '2007-10-09 01:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153590, 594871, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting and good poses. Some background light for separation would''ve helped.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting and good poses. Some background light for separation would''ve helped.', '2007-10-09 01:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153599, 594594, 57032, '<td valign="top">Good use of differing heights for your composition, but the fact that they''re looking into the sun doesn''t help the photo.</td>', 'Good use of differing heights for your composition, but the fact that they''re looking into the sun doesn''t help the photo.', '2007-10-09 01:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153601, 594170, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting way to photograph the staff, but the people in the back aren''t visible and those along the edges are stretched. When shooting wide angle, people should never be placed near the edges of the image.</td>', 'Interesting way to photograph the staff, but the people in the back aren''t visible and those along the edges are stretched. When shooting wide angle, people should never be placed near the edges of the image.', '2007-10-09 01:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153608, 594358, 57032, '<td valign="top">The way this is composed, it looks like the videographer has a mohawk. The girl with red hair, who I presume is your subject, is blurry in the face. There''s also a distracting reflection up in the top left corner. The image could use some sharpness, in my opinion, along with either a boost in colour or simply a conversion to B&amp;W.</td>', 'The way this is composed, it looks like the videographer has a mohawk. The girl with red hair, who I presume is your subject, is blurry in the face. There''s also a distracting reflection up in the top left corner. The image could use some sharpness, in my opinion, along with either a boost in colour or simply a conversion to B&W.', '2007-10-09 01:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153609, 593790, 57032, '<td valign="top">Nice background and good composition of the group. They could use some fill flash, but overall a pretty good group portrait.</td>', 'Nice background and good composition of the group. They could use some fill flash, but overall a pretty good group portrait.', '2007-10-09 01:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153612, 594166, 57032, '<td valign="top">Interesting poses and expressions.</td>', 'Interesting poses and expressions.', '2007-10-09 01:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153722, 594862, 41144, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2007-10-09 04:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153738, 593813, 44878, '<td valign="top">I think you missed a Great opportunity here<br/>They looklike they have lost their Pet Cat or something.<br/>I think I know your reason behind the pose but it doesnt sit right for me as if they smiled it would lighten the whole pag up.<br/>It will mark well for you as it is a Good portrait.<br/>Good Luck ad keep smiling !</td>', 'I think you missed a Great opportunity hereThey looklike they have lost their Pet Cat or something.I think I know your reason behind the pose but it doesnt sit right for me as if they smiled it would lighten the whole pag up.It will mark well for you as it is a Good portrait.Good Luck ad keep smiling !', '2007-10-09 04:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153753, 594803, 66353, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what to do with this - no vote</td>', 'I have no idea what to do with this - no vote', '2007-10-09 05:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153781, 592397, 79816, '<td valign="top">I like the idea - could have benefited from a better background and moving the group tighter together.</td>', 'I like the idea - could have benefited from a better background and moving the group tighter together.', '2007-10-09 06:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153783, 594146, 79816, '<td valign="top">America''s most wanted?</td>', 'America''s most wanted?', '2007-10-09 06:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153784, 594862, 79816, '<td valign="top">Looks like they had fun as well! Good shot</td>', 'Looks like they had fun as well! Good shot', '2007-10-09 06:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153785, 594543, 79816, '<td valign="top">The background is a little distracting, and better lighting on their faces would be good.</td>', 'The background is a little distracting, and better lighting on their faces would be good.', '2007-10-09 06:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153786, 592437, 79816, '<td valign="top">Great looking place, the group isn''t a strong enough feature of the photo though.</td>', 'Great looking place, the group isn''t a strong enough feature of the photo though.', '2007-10-09 06:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
