(4153790, 594166, 79816, '<td valign="top">I like the photo overall, shame it''s not terribly sharp. The girl in the green hat could have benefited from a little more light on her face.</td>', 'I like the photo overall, shame it''s not terribly sharp. The girl in the green hat could have benefited from a little more light on her face.', '2007-10-09 06:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153791, 594451, 79816, '<td valign="top">Great shot - good contrast - remind me not annoy the family! Would have been even better if the guy on the right moved a little to balance the photo.</td>', 'Great shot - good contrast - remind me not annoy the family! Would have been even better if the guy on the right moved a little to balance the photo.', '2007-10-09 06:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
