(4153925, 594543, 38032, '<td valign="top">I love this for some reason - I think it''s the discomfort and various expressions - like "should I smile?" - "is this what i''m supposed to do?" sorta thing.  An awkward posed moment that tells a story - whether we as the viewer like the story isn''t important.</td>', 'I love this for some reason - I think it''s the discomfort and various expressions - like "should I smile?" - "is this what i''m supposed to do?" sorta thing.  An awkward posed moment that tells a story - whether we as the viewer like the story isn''t important.', '2007-10-09 09:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153928, 593790, 38032, '<td valign="top">Good portrait. An odd feeling of night and day at the same time - inside and outside. soft and hard light.</td>', 'Good portrait. An odd feeling of night and day at the same time - inside and outside. soft and hard light.', '2007-10-09 09:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153931, 594902, 38032, '<td valign="top">LOL! The behive-esque pattern adds a great deal of interest to this allready interesting angle and moment.  I''d like to see a bit more in the frame bu assume you cropped with a reason.  Very beautiful image with a unique comp and content to peruse for a while.</td>', 'LOL! The behive-esque pattern adds a great deal of interest to this allready interesting angle and moment.  I''d like to see a bit more in the frame bu assume you cropped with a reason.  Very beautiful image with a unique comp and content to peruse for a while.', '2007-10-09 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153935, 593016, 38032, '<td valign="top">Awesome. The lighting and poses are great.  It seems a tad soft would be my only gripe.</td>', 'Awesome. The lighting and poses are great.  It seems a tad soft would be my only gripe.', '2007-10-09 09:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4153947, 594692, 79816, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, a shame about shadows on the faces.</td>', 'I like the colours, a shame about shadows on the faces.', '2007-10-09 09:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
