(4154404, 593790, 73799, '<td valign="top">it looks like it was taken in a studio... But if it was, then why are the shadows so harsh. And why does it look like there are mixed light (sources of different temperatures).  If you put a campfire in the bottom left it could help make the warm light from the left make sense.</td>', 'it looks like it was taken in a studio... But if it was, then why are the shadows so harsh. And why does it look like there are mixed light (sources of different temperatures).  If you put a campfire in the bottom left it could help make the warm light from the left make sense.', '2007-10-09 13:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
