(4155971, 593108, 74605, '<td valign="top">I so appreciate this photo!  It is one of my favorites in this challenge!  It has special meaning to me because I have breast cancer and I appreciate all the support give to breast cancer research.  Thank your for taking this photo, and especailly for sharing it here.</td>', 'I so appreciate this photo!  It is one of my favorites in this challenge!  It has special meaning to me because I have breast cancer and I appreciate all the support give to breast cancer research.  Thank your for taking this photo, and especailly for sharing it here.', '2007-10-10 01:17:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155975, 594543, 67697, '<td valign="top">You got some pretty harsh and totally non-constructive comments there.  And I am surprised at who made them.  I think you shoulda put a big ole cinnamon bun as the background, used special lighting to reflect off of that, and also had fountains of coffee flying overhead to turn your "snapshot" into a breakfast masterpiece!  hehe<br/> <br/>you know how it goes - commenting is a strange art form.  But what you have here is a memory of something that is unique to you and will be treasured for many years down the road.</td>', 'You got some pretty harsh and totally non-constructive comments there.  And I am surprised at who made them.  I think you shoulda put a big ole cinnamon bun as the background, used special lighting to reflect off of that, and also had fountains of coffee flying overhead to turn your "snapshot" into a breakfast masterpiece!  hehe you know how it goes - commenting is a strange art form.  But what you have here is a memory of something that is unique to you and will be treasured for many years down the road.', '2007-10-10 01:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155982, 593813, 62318, '<td valign="top">Blue Ribbon! Congrats. Lovely group portrait. Maybe a new career in portrait photography? You really seem to nail these shots.</td>', 'Blue Ribbon! Congrats. Lovely group portrait. Maybe a new career in portrait photography? You really seem to nail these shots.', '2007-10-10 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155983, 594202, 60195, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a masterful interpretation, and wonderful execution. Arguably the most <i>fore</i>thought given to an image on the entire site. It''s hard to say that with a 7.4 you were robbed... but I''m inclined ;O). Well done!</td>', 'Congrats on a masterful interpretation, and wonderful execution. Arguably the most forethought given to an image on the entire site. It''s hard to say that with a 7.4 you were robbed... but I''m inclined ;O). Well done!', '2007-10-10 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4155989, 594202, 47205, '<td valign="top">Dang, I love your retrospect in this. Amazing how you took the time and interpreted a very well known scene in your own view, and showed it in your art. I really like how you showed Peter in this, gave him a bit more personalism somehow. Well done sir, and congrats on your ribbon!</td>', 'Dang, I love your retrospect in this. Amazing how you took the time and interpreted a very well known scene in your own view, and showed it in your art. I really like how you showed Peter in this, gave him a bit more personalism somehow. Well done sir, and congrats on your ribbon!', '2007-10-10 01:19:54.000000', NULL, 0),
