(4156207, 594202, 42013, '<td valign="top">If an image ever deserved to dethrone the legendary pool table shot, this may have been the one. Do you work for a living? ;) Congrats!<br/> <br/>The followers of Christ were rough men, with a couple of exceptions. My reaction to your tatooed men is probably similar to the reaction of society to Jesus'' disciples.</td>', 'If an image ever deserved to dethrone the legendary pool table shot, this may have been the one. Do you work for a living? ;) Congrats! The followers of Christ were rough men, with a couple of exceptions. My reaction to your tatooed men is probably similar to the reaction of society to Jesus'' disciples.', '2007-10-10 02:17:54.000000', NULL, 0),
