(4156237, 592396, 53814, '<td valign="top">Great group portrait. Your processing fits the feel and message of the photo. It reminds me of the processing style "One Hour Photo" labs provided tourists not that many years ago. So, to me, your photo looks like it was taken by the person taking the other photo. If anything, your photo may be a little too well composed for the occasion - perhaps you should have chopped off the tops of their heads? Well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-10 06:09:40.</i></td>', 'Great group portrait. Your processing fits the feel and message of the photo. It reminds me of the processing style "One Hour Photo" labs provided tourists not that many years ago. So, to me, your photo looks like it was taken by the person taking the other photo. If anything, your photo may be a little too well composed for the occasion - perhaps you should have chopped off the tops of their heads? Well done.', '2007-10-10 02:31:13.000000', '2007-10-10 07:09:40.000000', 0),
(4156238, 594202, 33400, '<td valign="top">Outstanding interpretation. This was worth the effort.</td>', 'Outstanding interpretation. This was worth the effort.', '2007-10-10 02:31:16.000000', NULL, 0),
