(4156535, 594862, 82817, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on getting the red ribbon! Great shot and all that hair is going to a great cause.</td>', 'Congratulations on getting the red ribbon! Great shot and all that hair is going to a great cause.', '2007-10-10 05:39:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4156540, 592396, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, yay!!  This was you!  I meant to get back to comment on this - this is my personal blue ribbon pick, which granted is not as good as a Postie blue, but better than a rock in your shoe!  This epitomizes to me the group portrait.  Perfectly.  And I''m in a "photography as a record" sort of mood these days so this meets that as well.  You''re my hero!  :-)</td>', 'Oh, yay!!  This was you!  I meant to get back to comment on this - this is my personal blue ribbon pick, which granted is not as good as a Postie blue, but better than a rock in your shoe!  This epitomizes to me the group portrait.  Perfectly.  And I''m in a "photography as a record" sort of mood these days so this meets that as well.  You''re my hero!  :-)', '2007-10-10 05:41:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4156552, 594202, 42125, '<td valign="top">This is probably very close to what it would look like today if Jesus was among us. He did not pick the rich and "beautiful" to join him. Not even the priests. He chose the "scum" (to others) and he is also said to have not looked as beautiful as we all picture in our minds.<br/>Thank you for sharing this great picture.</td>', 'This is probably very close to what it would look like today if Jesus was among us. He did not pick the rich and "beautiful" to join him. Not even the priests. He chose the "scum" (to others) and he is also said to have not looked as beautiful as we all picture in our minds.Thank you for sharing this great picture.', '2007-10-10 05:46:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4156589, 594202, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Excellent Repro!</b>  The use of tattooed, apparently biker-types, is IMHO the cultural equivalent of the original Twelve''s station in Life!  <b>Nicely Done!  Congratulations!  :)</b></td>', 'Excellent Repro!  The use of tattooed, apparently biker-types, is IMHO the cultural equivalent of the original Twelve''s station in Life!  Nicely Done!  Congratulations!  :)', '2007-10-10 06:02:21.000000', NULL, 0),
