(4156707, 594202, 37108, '<td valign="top">Good work. I am stunned that you only used so few light to light upp the picture. and only using the 580 flass.<br/>This picture of last supper have been used so many times but your version is very nice<br/>*Keep upp the good work.<br/><a href="//www.lydur.is" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lydur</a> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.funatiq.com/images/last-supper-star-wars.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.funatiq.com/images/last-supper-star-wars.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.funatiq.com/images/last-supper-star-wars.jpg"/></td>', 'Good work. I am stunned that you only used so few light to light upp the picture. and only using the 580 flass.This picture of last supper have been used so many times but your version is very nice*Keep upp the good work.Lydur ', '2007-10-10 07:10:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4156723, 594202, 71249, '<td valign="top">Jorge, I run out of superlatives. Technique, lights but above all creativity are blue ribbon stuff. Subject has offended some and unfortunately with it some unmerited low votes, take those away and your masterpiece tops 8.</td>', 'Jorge, I run out of superlatives. Technique, lights but above all creativity are blue ribbon stuff. Subject has offended some and unfortunately with it some unmerited low votes, take those away and your masterpiece tops 8.', '2007-10-10 07:19:24.000000', NULL, 0),
