(4156860, 594202, 51386, '<td valign="top">De Sousa, this is an amazing image. I keep coming back to it. I love what you have done conceptually, as well as aesthetically. You have come back to prove yet again what kind of cool stuff you can do with hot-shoe flashes. Would love to see how this looks as a large print.</td>', 'De Sousa, this is an amazing image. I keep coming back to it. I love what you have done conceptually, as well as aesthetically. You have come back to prove yet again what kind of cool stuff you can do with hot-shoe flashes. Would love to see how this looks as a large print.', '2007-10-10 09:10:10.000000', NULL, 0),
