(4156888, 594516, 32767, '<td valign="top">Why am I not surprised that this didn''t do better? I should know by now, right? The voting was beyond strange in this Challenge but whatever the end result, you really captured a beautiful, genuine moment. Super cool...</td>', 'Why am I not surprised that this didn''t do better? I should know by now, right? The voting was beyond strange in this Challenge but whatever the end result, you really captured a beautiful, genuine moment. Super cool...', '2007-10-10 09:26:04.000000', NULL, 0),
