(4156947, 594202, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great image Jorge!!! I thought this might get tanked by some who might see it as sacrilege but happy it made it to the top. My first thought was that it reminded me of  <a href="//www.reneecox.net/images/series04/slide31.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Renee Cox''s</a> Last Supper that Rudy Giuliani got upset about and started a censorship campaign over.<br/> <br/>edited:just noticed that you got four 1''s. Glad they got shouted down by the 69 10''s. Yah!<br/> <br/>PS:Do all the people in Portugal look like that?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-10 10:16:39.</i></td>', 'Great image Jorge!!! I thought this might get tanked by some who might see it as sacrilege but happy it made it to the top. My first thought was that it reminded me of  Renee Cox''s Last Supper that Rudy Giuliani got upset about and started a censorship campaign over. edited:just noticed that you got four 1''s. Glad they got shouted down by the 69 10''s. Yah! PS:Do all the people in Portugal look like that?', '2007-10-10 09:53:52.000000', '2007-10-10 11:16:39.000000', 0),
