(4156992, 594202, 50695, '<td valign="top">The only thing missing is that one of them should be a woman! ;D<br/> <br/>Now I wish I had voted on this challenge. It would have been such a thrill to find this. Then again, it was thrilling to find it on the front page. The poses that you got from these guys are very impressive. Formal yet expressive.<br/> <br/>The only reason this didn''t get a blue is that you offended some people. That''s a great reason for not getting a blue!</td>', 'The only thing missing is that one of them should be a woman! ;D Now I wish I had voted on this challenge. It would have been such a thrill to find this. Then again, it was thrilling to find it on the front page. The poses that you got from these guys are very impressive. Formal yet expressive. The only reason this didn''t get a blue is that you offended some people. That''s a great reason for not getting a blue!', '2007-10-10 10:13:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4157003, 592396, 50695, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this challenge. This looks waaayyyy underrated.</td>', 'I didn''t vote this challenge. This looks waaayyyy underrated.', '2007-10-10 10:17:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4157009, 594202, 66348, '<td valign="top">Just an incredible shot my friend. I love your interpretation, and how much you really put into this. Each man has a feel and expression on his face that gives you a story. Love the break down of you shot, and the story behind all the different aspects of your work. Very well thought out and lit of course. It seems to be very difficult to have this many in your shot, and yet to have all perfectly representing the disciples. Well done! And also love that all of these are my Portuguese brothers!! Parabens!</td>', 'Just an incredible shot my friend. I love your interpretation, and how much you really put into this. Each man has a feel and expression on his face that gives you a story. Love the break down of you shot, and the story behind all the different aspects of your work. Very well thought out and lit of course. It seems to be very difficult to have this many in your shot, and yet to have all perfectly representing the disciples. Well done! And also love that all of these are my Portuguese brothers!! Parabens!', '2007-10-10 10:18:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4157017, 594698, 81783, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rodneyg:</b></div><hr/><i> Very cute kids.  I really don''t like this pose.  The girl in front is in focus and the others aren''t.  It should have been setup differently in my opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sorry, wasn''t set up.  I didn''t think a thing about this competition when I took this shot.  Just enjoyed the evening with my daughter and her friends.  But thank you everyone for your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by rodneyg: Very cute kids.  I really don''t like this pose.  The girl in front is in focus and the others aren''t.  It should have been setup differently in my opinion.   Sorry, wasn''t set up.  I didn''t think a thing about this competition when I took this shot.  Just enjoyed the evening with my daughter and her friends.  But thank you everyone for your comments.', '2007-10-10 10:21:49.000000', NULL, 0),
