(4157114, 594202, 78231, '<td valign="top">No offence to the top 2 entries, but i definatly think that this one is a clear winner. Mostly 10/10 scores. Not something you see happen often. But hey... you came <b>3</b>rd ;) maybe it was fate.<br/>Great work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-10 11:40:42.</i></td>', 'No offence to the top 2 entries, but i definatly think that this one is a clear winner. Mostly 10/10 scores. Not something you see happen often. But hey... you came 3rd ;) maybe it was fate.Great work.', '2007-10-10 10:51:44.000000', '2007-10-10 12:40:42.000000', 0),
(4157147, 594202, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jorge, I LOVE THIS!  Technically, it''s flawless of course like all your photos, but what touches me is that I really believe that if Jesus were here in the flesh today, these are the kinds of folks he would call friends.   He would be hanging out at his last supper with them, and prob''ly not the suits and ties that show up in church every time the doors are open, then leave the church and look down their noses at people who are different.   <br/> <br/>Thank you for giving us all the inside scoop on the thought and attention to detail you paid in setting this up.  You and your friends are absolutely THE BOMBS!!!!<br/> <br/>Adding it to my favorites too!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Jorge, I LOVE THIS!  Technically, it''s flawless of course like all your photos, but what touches me is that I really believe that if Jesus were here in the flesh today, these are the kinds of folks he would call friends.   He would be hanging out at his last supper with them, and prob''ly not the suits and ties that show up in church every time the doors are open, then leave the church and look down their noses at people who are different.    Thank you for giving us all the inside scoop on the thought and attention to detail you paid in setting this up.  You and your friends are absolutely THE BOMBS!!!! Adding it to my favorites too! ', '2007-10-10 11:02:25.000000', NULL, 0),
