(4159335, 594751, 68947, '<td valign="top">Sounds like there''s a general "grass phobia" going on in the comments here! LOL  <br/> <br/>Next time you go to take a shot.....take your lawn mower with you, will ya? (evil grin)<br/> <br/>Actually, I really think this is a really, really nice shot!  It gives us the perspective of being IN the grass with the girls.  I really like the rather "impromptu" sort of gathering here.  It''s just what a group of girls that age would do.....gather in bunches, lay in the grass and be silly! Good shot!  Should have done MUCH better than it did....but, I guess "grass phobias" win out! ;)</td>', 'Sounds like there''s a general "grass phobia" going on in the comments here! LOL   Next time you go to take a shot.....take your lawn mower with you, will ya? (evil grin) Actually, I really think this is a really, really nice shot!  It gives us the perspective of being IN the grass with the girls.  I really like the rather "impromptu" sort of gathering here.  It''s just what a group of girls that age would do.....gather in bunches, lay in the grass and be silly! Good shot!  Should have done MUCH better than it did....but, I guess "grass phobias" win out! ;)', '2007-10-11 00:55:43.000000', NULL, 0),
