(4159555, 593380, 68586, '<td valign="top">I think this was a very good idea for a group portrait. You have captured a distinct group of people whose unique identity is getting diluted all the time and this is reflected in their appearence with some ethnic items that they choose to wear and still hold onto and the rest simply becoming western type dress.<br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-11 03:16:23.</i></td>', 'I think this was a very good idea for a group portrait. You have captured a distinct group of people whose unique identity is getting diluted all the time and this is reflected in their appearence with some ethnic items that they choose to wear and still hold onto and the rest simply becoming western type dress. ', '2007-10-11 04:14:58.000000', '2007-10-11 04:16:23.000000', 0),
(4159644, 594862, 70828, '<td valign="top">What a great shot and a fantastic charity. Very moving story.</td>', 'What a great shot and a fantastic charity. Very moving story.', '2007-10-11 06:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4159971, 594543, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh that is SO TRUE!  Thank you for reminding me that sometimes the most precious memories are captured in. . .the dpc-forbidden. . .<i>snapshot</i>!<br/> <br/>I wonder how many of them I have tossed aside because the lighting wasn''t perfect, or there was a distracting element in the background.  But looking back at some of the best and even famous photographs from days gone by, they are just that:  snapshots, and some of them sell for big bucks too!<br/> <br/>Thanks for sharing your memory with us!  It warmed my heart today.  So, are you out of Iraq now???????    Whew!   I''ll be glad when you''re back home with your kitties!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh that is SO TRUE!  Thank you for reminding me that sometimes the most precious memories are captured in. . .the dpc-forbidden. . .snapshot! I wonder how many of them I have tossed aside because the lighting wasn''t perfect, or there was a distracting element in the background.  But looking back at some of the best and even famous photographs from days gone by, they are just that:  snapshots, and some of them sell for big bucks too! Thanks for sharing your memory with us!  It warmed my heart today.  So, are you out of Iraq now???????    Whew!   I''ll be glad when you''re back home with your kitties! ', '2007-10-11 11:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
