(4162400, 593813, 52713, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scarbrd''s notes:</b></div><hr/><i>I didn''t have Mary, my wife, with me, to comfirm that I wasn''t some sort of weirdo.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Would she really confirm that?? :P </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, we were at church, so I hope she''d back me up! ;-)<br/> <br/>I can not tell what an odd feeling it is to walk up to people you don''t really know very well and say, "You have beautiful daughters! Is it OK if I take their picture and put it up on the Internet?" <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-13 09:45:31.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao:  Originally posted by scarbrd''s notes:I didn''t have Mary, my wife, with me, to comfirm that I wasn''t some sort of weirdo. Would she really confirm that?? :P   Well, we were at church, so I hope she''d back me up! ;-) I can not tell what an odd feeling it is to walk up to people you don''t really know very well and say, "You have beautiful daughters! Is it OK if I take their picture and put it up on the Internet?" ', '2007-10-12 10:14:28.000000', '2007-10-13 10:45:31.000000', 0),
