(4198691, 594543, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you entered this, Deb.  As you noted, sometimes sharing a memory is more important than DPC''s idea of perfection.</td>', 'I''m glad you entered this, Deb.  As you noted, sometimes sharing a memory is more important than DPC''s idea of perfection.', '2007-10-27 00:18:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198699, 594803, 60862, '<td valign="top">Congrats for a most excellent performance!  I really do respect you for living up to your end of the bargain, and I don''t understand the people who can''t see the joke. :) So here''s a fave for ya.</td>', 'Congrats for a most excellent performance!  I really do respect you for living up to your end of the bargain, and I don''t understand the people who can''t see the joke. :) So here''s a fave for ya.', '2007-10-27 00:24:08.000000', NULL, 0),
