(4288927, 594202, 80878, '<td valign="top">Been a christian for years... This is one of the most inspiring pieces of art I''ve seen. Love it. (in referance to the comment below- yeah I too don''t think Jesus would have actually have had a tatoo; but I dont believe it to be a sin. However I do love the symbolism of it...) I hope you don''t mind everyone looking into the piece! lol Is this ever going up for sale?</td>', 'Been a christian for years... This is one of the most inspiring pieces of art I''ve seen. Love it. (in referance to the comment below- yeah I too don''t think Jesus would have actually have had a tatoo; but I dont believe it to be a sin. However I do love the symbolism of it...) I hope you don''t mind everyone looking into the piece! lol Is this ever going up for sale?', '2007-12-04 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4301909, 593010, 48651, '<td valign="top">Love it.</td>', 'Love it.', '2007-12-08 16:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4303168, 594543, 63495, '<td valign="top">Thanks Deb, sorry i didnt see this one earlier. i agree to me a photo is to capture a moment in time be it be a place, people ,or an emotion.</td>', 'Thanks Deb, sorry i didnt see this one earlier. i agree to me a photo is to capture a moment in time be it be a place, people ,or an emotion.', '2007-12-09 10:18:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4315819, 594780, 31637, '<td valign="top">Lazy dudes drinking while the girl does the dirty work? Nah man... :)</td>', 'Lazy dudes drinking while the girl does the dirty work? Nah man... :)', '2007-12-15 10:44:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4315940, 594780, 87278, '<td valign="top">I like the tongue-in-cheek title! Many motivational/instructional posters sound so sermonizing, this is bound to leave an impression and perhaps drive home the message straight (even with a flat tire! LOL!!! :-)<br/>A second look makes me feel there seems to be more irony than meets the eye - the thinnest girl in the group (team, eh?) seems to be doing the job!<br/> <br/>This goes straight into my fav! Can I use it - in a non commercial way?</td>', 'I like the tongue-in-cheek title! Many motivational/instructional posters sound so sermonizing, this is bound to leave an impression and perhaps drive home the message straight (even with a flat tire! LOL!!! :-)A second look makes me feel there seems to be more irony than meets the eye - the thinnest girl in the group (team, eh?) seems to be doing the job! This goes straight into my fav! Can I use it - in a non commercial way?', '2007-12-15 12:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
