(4397669, 594202, 69102, '<td valign="top">I apologize - profusely, and at length - for not putting you into my favorite photographers before now. Very cool work (not just this). Well thought out and executed. You rock.</td>', 'I apologize - profusely, and at length - for not putting you into my favorite photographers before now. Very cool work (not just this). Well thought out and executed. You rock.', '2008-01-16 16:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
