(4785081, 594202, 44877, '<td valign="top">I just stumbled upon this photo again. I have to say, it''s one of the best I''ve seen on DPC. The setup and mindfulness that went into this is just amazing. I''ve actually showed it to people who are neither on DPC nor into photography. <br/> <br/>It would probably look utterly stunning in large in a cool frame on the wall.</td>', 'I just stumbled upon this photo again. I have to say, it''s one of the best I''ve seen on DPC. The setup and mindfulness that went into this is just amazing. I''ve actually showed it to people who are neither on DPC nor into photography.  It would probably look utterly stunning in large in a cool frame on the wall.', '2008-06-25 10:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
